window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-7"] = [{"id":1,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第一章：六年一班的新救星\n\n鹿陽國小的走廊上，永遠流傳著關於「六年一班」的恐怖傳說。\n\n據說，這個班級在上學期剛逼瘋了第三位實習老師——那位可憐的李老師在連續批改了一百篇寫著「我的志願是發明一種會自己寫作業的鉛筆」的作文後，眼神渙散地交出辭呈，跑去深山閉關修仙了。\n\n而今天，是新學期的第一天。\n\n晨光透過六年一班略帶粉筆灰的窗戶灑了進來。教室後排，全班最皮的「點子王」轆慄釁（外號阿釁），正鬼鬼祟祟地蹲在講台後面。\n\n「阿釁，你確定這招有用？」\n\n說話的是巫茞輆。大家平時都叫他「老巫」，老巫人如其名……呃，其實一點也不像巫師，反倒長得白白胖胖、敦厚老實，手裡永遠拿著半個剛出爐的肉包，正一邊嚼著一邊緊張地盯著門口。「上一位老師就是被你的『抽屜跳跳糖水草蜘蛛』嚇跑的，這次學務處黑面主任肯定盯得很緊。」\n\n「安啦！這次可是高科技升級版！」阿釁得意洋洋地展示手裡的黑板擦。\n\n那不是普通的黑板擦。阿釁在黑板擦上方綁了一條極細的釣魚線，只要新老師推開教室門，講台上方那盒堆得老高的粉筆灰，就會像「暴風雪降臨」一樣，精準無誤地扣在對方的腦門上。\n\n坐在第一排的班長綝耘晴推了推眼鏡，手裡還拿著一把小螺絲起子，冷冷地開口：\n「從物理學角度來看，你的釣魚線摩擦係數太大，門推開的加速度如果低於每秒零點五公尺，粉筆灰只會灑在講台正中央——也就是等一下你自己要上去罰站的位置。」\n\n「綝耘晴，妳少潑冷水！」阿釁抗議。\n\n就在這時，通風管口突然「嗖」地閃過一道銀白色的靈動身影！\n\n那是全班同學偷偷合資合養的 AI 智慧小寵物——「溜溜」。\n\n溜溜外形長得既像一隻毛茸茸的小白鼠，又長著一對像小狐狸般靈活警惕的尖耳朵，後面拖著一條蓬鬆的金屬光澤尾巴。牠的速度快得像一道閃電，是全校所有八卦、秘密情報與巡堂主任動線的超級情報王！\n\n只見溜溜輕巧地從天花板電線管倒掛下來，兩隻黑曜石般的電子眼珠瘋狂閃爍著紅光，小嘴發出急促的電子警戒聲：\n\n「嗶嗶！警報！警報！新目標出現在走廊轉角！距離後門三十公尺……二十公尺……十公尺！氣場強度五顆星！重複，五顆星！」\n\n播報完畢，溜溜「刷」一聲如同一道白色殘影，直接鑽進了黑板後方的專屬充電小窩裡。\n\n教室裡瞬間安靜得連一根針掉在地上都能聽見。二十六雙眼睛齊刷刷地盯著虛掩的教室木門。\n\n「吱呀——」\n\n門被推開了。\n\n釣魚線瞬間繃直！講台頂端那一盒累積了整整一個暑假、厚實濃密的白色粉筆灰，帶著呼嘯的風聲，直直往門口砸了下去！\n\n阿釁差點興奮地跳起來大喊「中獎了」——\n\n然而，下一秒發生的畫面，讓整個六年一班的空氣徹底凝固。\n\n走進來的男人沒有尖叫，也沒有狼狽地抱頭。\n\n甚至，他連眉頭都沒有皺一下。\n\n他穿著一套黑灰相間的合身西裝，打著一條紅藍斜紋領帶，整齊得就像剛從乾洗店拆下塑膠套。鼻樑上架著一副極有質感的黑框眼鏡，頭髮梳得一絲不苟，每一根髮絲的角度彷彿都經過量角器精準測量。\n\n就在粉筆灰盒距離他的頭頂僅剩五公分的千鈞一髮之際——\n\n「嗖！」\n\n男人的右手以不可思議的殘影速度向上抬起。五隻手指如行雲流水般在空中畫出一個半弧，粉筆灰盒在空中優雅地旋轉了兩圈，裡頭所有的粉筆灰竟然連一顆微粒都沒有灑出來，被他穩穩地托在掌心上！\n\n「落體初速度：每秒二點四公尺。目標質量：一百八十公克。包含碳酸鈣粉末百分之九十二、空氣阻力系數零點四七。」\n\n男人的聲音平穩、清脆，帶著一種奇異的金屬磁性，既像收音機裡的專業主播，又像最新型旗艦手機的語音助理：\n\n「早上好，六年一班的各位同學。我是你們這學期的新導師——高峙舷。」\n\n全班張大嘴巴，下巴集體砸在課桌上。\n\n老巫嘴裡的肉包「啪嗒」一聲掉在桌上，他也忘了撿。\n\n高峙舷老師踩著節奏完全一致的步伐走上講台。每一步的跨距恰好是七十五公分，鞋底敲擊地板的聲音規律得像節拍器：「嗒、嗒、嗒、嗒」。\n\n他輕輕將粉筆盒放在桌角，推了推黑框眼鏡。\n\n就在他推眼鏡的剎那，坐在第一排的綝耘晴敏銳地注意到：高老師鏡片後的瞳孔深處，有一圈微不可察的淡藍色光環，像相機對焦一樣輕輕縮放了一下。\n\n「根據本校學生資料庫，」高老師目光掃視全班，「本班應到人數二十六人，實到二十五人。缺席者為座號十四號的李小明同學——他目前在第二教學大樓二樓的廁所，因為上學路上喝了過期的冬瓜檸檬，預計還有三分四十二秒才會抵達教室。」\n\n「欸？真的假的？連冬瓜檸檬都知道？！」阿釁忍不住嘀咕。\n\n高老師的目光瞬間鎖定了最後排的阿釁。\n\n「轆慄釁同學，身高一百四十二公分，體重三十四點五公斤。今早出門前左腳襪子穿反，書包側袋裝有一包跳跳糖、兩顆溜溜球，以及作業本裡夹著的三張沒寫完的數學考卷。」\n\n阿釁整個人差點從椅子上彈飛起來。他下意識摸了摸自己的書包側袋——分毫不差！連他今早偷偷把數學考卷塞進底層的事情都被看穿了！\n\n黑板後面的溜溜從縫隙探出尖尖的狐狸耳朵，電子眼瘋狂計算著高老師的威脅值。\n\n「最後，」高老師轉向呆滯的老巫，「巫茞輆同學，你掉在桌上的肉包還有五十七秒的賞味期，內部溫度降至攝氏四十二度，再不吃油脂會凝固，影響吸收率百分之十三。」\n\n老巫反射性地把肉包塞進嘴裡，猛點頭：「好、好的老師！我馬上吃！」\n\n這不是老師。\n\n這絕對不是一般的實習老師！\n\n六年一班所有的皮蛋們心裡同時閃過這個念頭——他們遇到大魔王了。一個能計算落體重力、能透視書包、甚至能精準監控腸胃蠕動的究極大魔王！\n\n晨光灑在高峙舷老師那張毫無瑕疵的英俊臉龐上，他的嘴角微微上揚，露出標準的四十五度微笑：\n\n「那麼，請打開國語課本第一頁，我們的六年級新學期，現在開始。」\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 1: The New Savior of Class 6-1\n\nAlong the hallways of Luyang Elementary School, terrifying legends about \"Class 6-1\" were constantly passed down.\n\nRumor had it that just last semester, this class drove their third trainee teacher to the brink of insanity—that poor Teacher Li, after grading a hundred consecutive essays titled \"My Dream Is to Invent a Pencil That Writes Homework by Itself,\" handed in his resignation with hollow eyes and fled to a secluded mountain to cultivate Taoist immortality.\n\nAnd today was the first day of the new semester.\n\nMorning sunlight streamed through the slightly chalk-dusted windows of Class 6-1. In the back of the classroom, the class's most mischievous \"King of Ideas,\" Lu Lixin (nicknamed A-Xin), was crouched stealthily behind the podium.\n\n\"A-Xin, are you sure this will actually work?\"\n\nThe speaker was Wu Chenkai. Everyone usually called him \"Old Wu.\" Old Wu's nickname sounded mysterious... well, truth be told, he looked nothing like a sorcerer; rather, he was plump, fair, and good-natured. He perpetually held half a freshly steamed pork bun in his hand, chewing as he stared nervously at the classroom door. \"The last teacher ran away after being spooked by your 'Jumping Candy Waterweed Spider in the Desk.' This time, Black-Faced Director from the Student Affairs Office will definitely keep a close eye on us.\"\n\n\"Relax! This time it's a high-tech upgraded edition!\" A-Xin proudly displayed the blackboard eraser in his hand.\n\nThat was no ordinary blackboard eraser. A-Xin had fastened an ultra-fine fishing line to the top of it. As soon as the new teacher pushed open the classroom door, the box of chalk dust piled high above the podium would descend like a \"blizzard blizzard,\" slamming squarely and accurately onto their forehead.\n\nSitting in the front row, Class President Lin Yunqing adjusted her glasses, holding a miniature screwdriver in her hand, and spoke coldly:\n\"From a physics perspective, the coefficient of friction on your fishing line is too large. If the door opens with an acceleration of less than 0.5 meters per second, the chalk dust will only drop right at the center of the podium—which happens to be the exact spot where you'll be standing in detention later.\"\n\n\"Lin Yunqing, stop pouring cold water on me!\" A-Xin protested.\n\nRight at that moment, an agile silver-white figure flashed across the vent with a whoosh!\n\nIt was the AI smart pet secretly co-funded and raised by the entire class—\"Liu-Liu.\"\n\nLiu-Liu looked like a fluffy white mouse yet possessed a pair of sharp, alert ears like a little fox, trailing a bushy tail with a metallic sheen behind it. Moving as fast as lightning, it was the ultimate gossip king regarding all school rumors, confidential intel, and the patrolling patrol routes of the Dean of Students!\n\nLiu-Liu dangled gracefully upside-down from the ceiling wire conduit, its obsidian-like electronic eyes blinking furiously with red light, as its tiny mouth issued a rapid electronic warning:\n\n\"Beep-beep! Alert! Alert! New target spotted at the corridor corner! Distance to back door: thirty meters... twenty meters... ten meters! Aura intensity: five stars! Repeat, five stars!\"\n\nHaving completed its broadcast, Liu-Liu vanished like a white afterimage with a swish, darting straight into its dedicated little charging nook behind the blackboard.\n\nThe classroom instantly grew so quiet that one could hear a pin drop on the floor. Twenty-six pairs of eyes stared in unison at the ajar wooden classroom door.\n\n\"Creak—\"\n\nThe door was pushed open.\n\nThe fishing line snapped taut in an instant! Perched atop the podium, the box of chalk dust—accumulated over an entire summer vacation, thick and dense—plunged straight toward the doorway with a howling gust of wind!\n\nA-Xin nearly jumped for joy, about to yell \"Bingo!\"—\n\nHowever, what happened in the very next second caused the air in Class 6-1 to freeze completely.\n\nThe man who walked in did not scream, nor did he frantically clutch his head.\n\nIn fact, he didn't even knit his brows.\n\nHe wore a tailored dark gray suit with a red-and-blue diagonal striped tie, as pristine as if it had just been peeled from dry-cleaner plastic wrap. A stylish pair of black-framed glasses rested on his nose, and his hair was combed meticulously, every strand angled as though precisely calibrated by a protractor.\n\nAt the hairsbreadth moment when the box of chalk dust was a mere five centimeters above his head—\n\n\"Swish!\"\n\nThe man's right hand rose upward at an impossible, blur-like speed. His five fingers carved a smooth arc in midair, and the chalk box spun elegantly twice in the air without spilling a single speck of dust, coming to rest steadily in the palm of his hand!\n\n\"Initial free-fall velocity: 2.4 meters per second. Target mass: 180 grams. Composition: 92 percent calcium carbonate powder; aerodynamic drag coefficient: 0.47.\"\n\nThe man's voice was steady and crisp, imbued with a peculiar metallic resonance, sounding both like a professional radio announcer and the voice assistant of the latest flagship smartphone:\n\n\"Good morning, students of Class 6-1. I am your new homeroom teacher for this semester—Gao Zhixian.\"\n\nThe entire class dropped their jaws, their chins smacking against their desks in unison.\n\nThe pork bun in Old Wu's mouth fell onto his desk with a plop, and he completely forgot to pick it up.\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian strode onto the podium with strides of perfectly identical rhythm. Each step measured exactly seventy-five centimeters, the sound of his soles striking the floor as rhythmic as a metronome: \"Tap, tap, tap, tap.\"\n\nHe gently placed the chalk box on the corner of the desk and pushed up his black-framed glasses.\n\nAt the very instant he pushed his glasses, Lin Yunqing, sitting in the front row, keenly caught sight of it: deep within Teacher Gao's pupils behind the lenses, a faint, almost imperceptible pale blue ring contracted and expanded slightly, just like a camera lens focusing.\n\n\"According to this school's student database,\" Teacher Gao's gaze swept over the entire room, \"the expected attendance for this class is twenty-six students, with twenty-five present. The absentee is Student Number 14, Li Xiaoming—currently located on the second floor of Teaching Building Two in the restroom. Due to consuming expired winter melon lemon tea on his way to school, he is projected to arrive in three minutes and forty-two seconds.\"\n\n\"Huh? Seriously? He even knows about the winter melon lemon tea?!\" A-Xin couldn't help muttering.\n\nTeacher Gao's gaze locked onto A-Xin in the back row instantly.\n\n\"Student Lu Lixin: height 142 centimeters, weight 34.5 kilograms. Put on his left sock inside-out before leaving home this morning. Carrying a packet of Pop Rocks, two yo-yos in his backpack side pocket, and three unfinished math test sheets tucked inside his workbook.\"\n\nA-Xin almost bounced right out of his seat. He instinctively felt his backpack's side pocket—not an error in sight! Even the fact that he secretly shoved his math test papers into the very bottom this morning had been seen through!\n\nBehind the blackboard, Liu-Liu poked its pointy fox ears through the crack, its electronic eyes frantically calculating Teacher Gao's threat level.\n\n\"Finally,\" Teacher Gao turned toward the dazed Old Wu, \"Student Wu Chenkai, the pork bun on your desk has fifty-seven seconds remaining in its optimal tasting window. Its internal temperature has dropped to forty-two degrees Celsius. If not consumed immediately, the fats will coagulate, reducing nutrient absorption by thirteen percent.\"\n\nOld Wu reflexively shoved the bun into his mouth and nodded vigorously: \"Y-Yes, Teacher! I'll eat it right away!\"\n\nThis was no teacher.\n\nThis was definitely no ordinary trainee teacher!\n\nThe same thought flashed simultaneously through the minds of all the rascals in Class 6-1—they had encountered an ultimate final boss. A supreme final boss capable of computing gravitational acceleration, seeing through backpacks, and even monitoring intestinal digestion with pinpoint precision!\n\nThe morning sun bathed Teacher Gao Zhixian's flawless, handsome face. The corners of his mouth curved upward slightly, forming a textbook forty-five-degree smile:\n\n\"Now, please turn to page one of your language textbook. Our sixth-grade semester begins now.\"\n"},{"id":2,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第二章：黑板前的「鏗啷」聲\n\n第一堂課是國語課。\n\n六年一班的教室裡出現了建校以來最不可思議的奇景：二十六個平時像上了發條的猴子一樣吵鬧的學生，此刻全部挺直腰桿、雙手平放桌上，乖得像在接受總統接見。\n\n沒辦法，誰敢動啊！\n\n剛才下課前，隔壁班的調皮大王陳阿達拿著一顆籃球從走廊跑過去，球不小心手滑飛進六年一班窗戶。高峙舷老師連頭都沒回，反手一撈，單手就把高速旋轉的籃球穩穩抓在指尖上，甚至還順便報出了球體氣壓是「8.7 psi，建議補氣」。\n\n「現在，請各位同學看黑板。」\n\n高老師轉過身，拿起一根白色粉筆。\n\n他在黑板上書寫的速度快得驚人，粉筆敲擊黑板的節奏如同機關槍掃射：「噠噠噠噠噠噠！」\n\n每一劃的橫平豎直都像用雷射尺標定過，字體標準得彷彿直接把教科書掃描投射在黑板上一樣。全班看得目瞪口呆，坐在最前面的綝耘晴更是屏住了呼吸。\n\n然而，就在高老師寫到最後一個字「學」的最後一筆時——\n\n「嘰……滋滋……」\n\n一聲極微弱、類似金屬齒輪乾澀摩擦的尖銳異音，從高老師的後頸衣領處傳了出來。\n\n黑板後方的通風口裡，AI 小寵物「溜溜」的兩隻尖耳朵猛地一抖，鼻頭上的微型感應器發出細微的「嗶嗶」聲，小腦袋警惕地探了出來。\n\n緊接著，高老師的動作突然停格了零點五秒。\n\n他的右手臂像是受潮的發條娃娃，以極微小的幅度抽搐了一下。\n\n「鏗啷——！！」\n\n一聲清脆無比的金屬撞擊聲在安靜的教室裡炸響！\n\n某個沉甸甸的小東西從高老師後腦勺的髮際線邊緣滑落，撞在木質講台上，彈跳了兩下，隨後咕嚕嚕地順著微傾斜的磨石子地板一路往下滾。\n\n「咕嚕嚕……咕嚕嚕……」\n\n全班二十六雙眼睛的視線，像雷達一樣死死鎖定著那個滾動的金色小圓點。溜溜甚至靈活地順著窗簾滑下，藏在窗台後方，兩顆電子眼球像變焦鏡頭一樣迅速對焦。\n\n金色小圓點滾過綝耘晴的桌邊，掠過老巫掉在地上的肉包塑膠袋，最後「咚」的一聲，不偏不倚撞在轆慄釁（阿釁）的球鞋鞋尖上，晃了兩圈，靜靜躺平。\n\n阿釁下意識低頭看去。\n\n那不是硬幣，也不是原子筆的零件。\n\n那是一顆約莫五十元硬幣大小、泛著冷冽暗金色光澤的「黃銅行星齒輪」。齒輪的切面精細到了極點，上面密密麻麻咬合著二十四個微型齒牙，中心甚至刻著一行極小的編號：【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】。\n\n「……齒輪？」阿釁喃喃自語。\n\n人的後腦勺……為什麼會掉出一顆齒輪？！\n\n阿釁猛地抬頭看向講台。\n\n只見高峙舷老師依然背對著大家，整個人維持著右手拿粉筆懸在半空的姿勢，足足靜止了五秒鐘。\n\n隨後，高老師的頸椎發出了一陣宛如古董鐘錶發條轉動的聲音：「卡噠、卡噠、卡噠。」\n\n他慢慢轉過身來。\n\n坐在第一排的綝耘晴倒抽了一口涼氣——高老師那副黑框眼鏡的鏡片內側，原本一閃而過代表正常的藍光，此刻竟然瘋狂閃爍著刺眼的橘黃色光芒！\n\n鏡片邊緣甚至隱約跑過一串綠色的微型程式碼：\n\n`[WARNING]`\n`[Critical Component Missing: #03 Common-Sense Damper (常識與修辭調節器) OFFLINE]`\n`[Fallback Mode: Literal Interpretation (絕對字面解析模式) ENABLED]`\n\n「老師……」\n\n坐在第二排的小胖妹林芸芸怯生生地舉起手，臉色發白地問道：「老師，您的頭……剛剛是不是掉零件了？」\n\n高老師推了推眼鏡。橘黃色的光芒在眼鏡推動的瞬間被他強制壓制下去，變成了平靜的無色。\n\n「林芸芸同學，本系統……咳，本人的身體構造由百分之六十的水分、蛋白質與鈣質構成，不具備可拆卸零件。」\n\n高老師的語調依然平穩，但仔細聽的話，聲音裡似乎多了一絲微妙的機械延遲感：「方才的聲響，是本人的神經突觸與空氣中微粒產生的音頻共振。純屬自然生理現象。」\n\n全班面面相覷。連窗台上的溜溜都歪著毛茸茸的小腦袋，螢幕眼露出一個巨大的「？」符號。\n\n「神經突觸跟空氣微粒共振」能發出那麼響的鐵打聲？誰信啊！\n\n這時，阿釁悄悄伸出腳，用鞋底把那顆金黃色的齒輪往自己椅子下方勾，動作快得像偷地瓜的土撥鼠。\n\n阿釁舉手：「報告高老師！」\n\n高老師目光轉向阿釁：「轆慄釁同學，請說。」\n\n「老師，剛才第一節課太刺激了，我現在肚子快要餓扁了！」阿釁試探性地說道。\n\n在平常，任何一個人類老師聽到這句話，頂多會翻個白眼說「忍耐一下，等中午吃午餐」或者「誰叫你早餐不吃」。\n\n然而——\n\n聽完這句話的高老師，雙眼瞳孔突然瞬間放大！\n\n「指令接收：轆慄釁同學的腹部厚度正在急遽下降，即將變為二維平面扁平狀態。」\n\n高老師的神色瞬間變得極度嚴肅，大步流星走下講台，帶著一陣狂風直奔阿釁的座位！\n\n「欸？老、老師你要幹嘛？！」阿釁嚇得差點翻下椅子。\n\n「緊急搶救人體厚度程序啟動。」\n\n高老師唰地從西裝內袋掏出一捲黃色的軟質工程皮尺，以光速「啪」的一聲纏住阿釁的腰部！\n\n「目前腹部厚度：十八點五公分。距離完全變扁尚有十八點四九公分的安全裕度。為防止完全扁平化導致內臟機能受損，必須立即進行膨脹填充。」\n\n高老師轉頭，目光如炬地掃過老巫的桌面：「巫茞輆同學，立刻徵用你抽屜備用的第二顆高麗菜肉包，對轆同學進行口服壓力填充！」\n\n全班同學：「？？？？？？？？」\n\n老巫手裡的肉包嚇得直接塞進自己嘴裡咬了一半：「老、老師！阿釁只是說他很餓而已啊！」\n\n「『快要餓扁』屬於明確物理狀態陳述，系統……本老師不接受隱喻。」\n\n高老師嚴肅地看著阿釁，甚至伸手拍了拍阿釁的肚皮，發出空洞的「咚咚」聲：\n\n「維持現有體積。不可變扁。這是導師的職責。」\n\n這一刻，整個六年一班鴉雀無聲。\n\n坐在旁邊的綝耘晴捂住嘴巴，眼中爆發出驚人的興奮光芒；\n窗台上的溜溜嚇得小尾巴炸毛，迅速竄回通風管；\n而阿釁低頭看著椅子下方那顆閃閃發亮的齒輪，腦海中只有一個巨大、滾燙的驚天結論在瘋狂轟鳴——\n\n天啊。\n\n這顆齒輪，絕對是從高老師身體裡掉出來的！\n\n他們的這位全能新班導……根本不是人類啊啊啊！！！\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 2: The Clinking Sound in Front of the Blackboard\n\nThe first period was language arts class.\n\nInside the classroom of Class 6-1, the most unbelievable spectacle since the founding of the school took place: twenty-six students who usually chattered like wound-up monkeys now sat with their backs ramrod straight and hands flat on their desks, behaving as solemnly as if they were being received by the president.\n\nAfter all, who dared make a move!\n\nRight before the bell rang, the mischievous prankster Chen Ada from the neighboring class was dribbling a basketball past the hallway when the ball accidentally slipped from his hands and flew right through the window of Class 6-1. Without even turning his head, Teacher Gao Zhixian casually reached backward, catching the high-speed spinning basketball firmly on his fingertips with a single hand, and even offhandedly reported that the ball's internal pressure was \"8.7 psi, inflation recommended.\"\n\n\"Now, everyone please direct your attention to the blackboard.\"\n\nTeacher Gao turned around and picked up a piece of white chalk.\n\nThe speed at which he wrote on the blackboard was astonishingly fast, the cadence of chalk striking slate resembling a rapid-fire machine gun: \"Da-da-da-da-da-da!\"\n\nEvery horizontal stroke and vertical line looked as if calibrated with a laser level, the script so standardized that it seemed as though the textbook had been scanned and projected directly onto the board. The entire class stared open-mouthed, and Lin Yunqing, sitting in the very front row, held her breath in awe.\n\nHowever, just as Teacher Gao was writing the final stroke of the last word \"learn\"—\n\n\"Squeak... bzzzz...\"\n\nA very faint, sharp, friction-laden screech, resembling dry metallic gears grinding against one another, emanated from behind Teacher Gao's collar at the nape of his neck.\n\nIn the vent behind the blackboard, the two pointy ears of the AI pet \"Liu-Liu\" twitched violently. The micro-sensor on its snout emitted a faint \"beep-beep,\" and its tiny head peeked out with intense wariness.\n\nImmediately after, Teacher Gao's motion froze abruptly for 0.5 seconds.\n\nHis right arm, like that of a damp clockwork doll, twitched with a microscopic tremor.\n\n\"Clink-clank—!!\"\n\nA crisp, unmistakable metallic crash reverberated loudly across the silent classroom!\n\nA heavy little object slipped from the edge of Teacher Gao's hairline at the back of his head, slammed onto the wooden podium, bounced twice, and then rolled clattering all the way down the slightly sloped terrazzo floor.\n\n\"Clatter-clatter... clatter-clatter...\"\n\nThe gazes of twenty-six pairs of eyes locked onto that rolling golden dot like radar. Liu-Liu even slid nimbly down the curtains, hiding behind the windowsill, its twin electronic eyeballs zooming rapidly like camera lenses.\n\nThe golden dot rolled past Lin Yunqing's desk, grazed past the plastic bag of Old Wu's dropped pork bun on the floor, and finally—thud!—bumped right into the toe of Lu Lixin's (A-Xin's) sneaker, wobbled twice, and lay flat in silence.\n\nA-Xin instinctively glanced down.\n\nIt wasn't a coin, nor was it a ballpoint pen part.\n\nIt was a \"brass planetary gear\" about the size of a fifty-dollar coin, gleaming with a cold, dark-golden luster. The gear's teeth were machined to the absolute extreme, densely interlocked with twenty-four miniature cogs, and the center was engraved with a microscopic serial code: 【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】.\n\n\"...A gear?\" A-Xin muttered under his breath.\n\nWhy on earth... would a gear fall out of the back of someone's head?!\n\nA-Xin jerked his head up toward the podium.\n\nThere stood Teacher Gao Zhixian, still facing away from everyone, maintaining the posture of holding chalk suspended in midair, completely motionless for five whole seconds.\n\nThen, the vertebrae of Teacher Gao's neck produced a winding sound reminiscent of an antique clockwork spring: \"Click, click, click.\"\n\nHe slowly turned around.\n\nLin Yunqing, sitting in the front row, gasped sharply—inside the lenses of Teacher Gao's black-framed glasses, the faint blue light that previously signified normal operations was now flashing frantically with a glaring orange-yellow flare!\n\nAlong the rims of the lenses, a stream of green micro-code faintly cascaded:\n\n`[WARNING]`\n`[Critical Component Missing: #03 Common-Sense Damper OFFLINE]`\n`[Fallback Mode: Literal Interpretation ENABLED]`\n\n\"Teacher...\"\n\nSitting in the second row, the chubby girl Lin Yunyun timidly raised her hand, asking with a pale face, \"Teacher... did your head just drop a spare part?\"\n\nTeacher Gao adjusted his glasses. The moment he pushed the frame, the orange-yellow glare was forcefully suppressed, returning to tranquil transparency.\n\n\"Student Lin Yunyun, this system... ahem, my biological body is composed of sixty percent water, protein, and calcium. It does not possess detachable components.\"\n\nTeacher Gao's tone remained calm, but upon close listening, there seemed to be a subtle mechanical latency in his voice: \"The sound just now was merely an acoustic resonance generated between my neural synapses and airborne particulates. A purely natural physiological phenomenon.\"\n\nThe whole class looked at each other in bewilderment. Even Liu-Liu on the windowsill tilted its furry little head, displaying a giant \"?\" symbol on its screen-eyes.\n\n\"Acoustic resonance between neural synapses and air particles\" could make such a resounding metallic clatter? Who would believe that!\n\nAt that moment, A-Xin covertly stretched his foot out, using his shoe sole to hook that golden gear beneath his chair, moving as swift as a groundhog stealing sweet potatoes.\n\nA-Xin raised his hand: \"Report, Teacher Gao!\"\n\nTeacher Gao turned his gaze toward A-Xin: \"Student Lu Lixin, speak.\"\n\n\"Teacher, that first class was way too intense. Right now, my stomach is so hungry it's about to be flattened flat!\" A-Xin ventured testing the waters.\n\nUnder normal circumstances, any human teacher hearing this would at most roll their eyes and say \"Hold on until lunch\" or \"Who told you to skip breakfast?\"\n\nHowever—\n\nUpon hearing those words, Teacher Gao's pupils instantly dilated!\n\n\"Instruction received: Student Lu Lixin's abdominal thickness is decreasing precipitously, imminent transition to a two-dimensional flat plane.\"\n\nTeacher Gao's expression turned intensely grave. Taking long, sweeping strides, he marched down from the podium, rushing straight toward A-Xin's desk accompanied by a gust of wind!\n\n\"Whoa? T-Teacher, what are you doing?!\" A-Xin was so startled he nearly fell off his chair.\n\n\"Emergency human body thickness rescue protocol engaged.\"\n\nTeacher Gao whipped out a yellow flexible engineering tape measure from inside his suit pocket with a swoosh, snapping it around A-Xin's waist at the speed of light!\n\n\"Current abdominal thickness: 18.5 centimeters. Safety margin before absolute two-dimensional flattening: 18.49 centimeters. To prevent visceral organ dysfunction caused by total flattening, pneumatic expansion filling must be administered immediately.\"\n\nTeacher Gao turned his head, his fiery gaze sweeping over Old Wu's desk: \"Student Wu Chenkai, immediately requisition the backup cabbage pork bun from your drawer to perform oral pressure-filling on Student Lu!\"\n\nThe entire class: \"???????????\"\n\nThe pork bun in Old Wu's hand was so shocked that he accidentally bit halfway into it himself: \"T-Teacher! A-Xin was just saying he's hungry!\"\n\n\"'About to be flattened' constitutes an explicit physical state assertion. This system... this teacher does not accept metaphors.\"\n\nTeacher Gao regarded A-Xin with utmost gravity, even reaching out to pat A-Xin's belly, producing hollow \"thump-thump\" sounds:\n\n\"Maintain current volumetric mass. Flattening is prohibited. Such is the duty of a homeroom teacher.\"\n\nAt this moment, the entire Class 6-1 fell into dead silence.\n\nSitting beside him, Lin Yunqing covered her mouth, an astonishing burst of excitement erupting in her eyes;\nOn the windowsill, Liu-Liu was so startled that its tail fur stood on end, scampering back into the vent in a flash;\nAnd A-Xin, looking down at the gleaming gear beneath his chair, felt only one colossal, blistering revelation roaring madly through his mind—\n\nGood heavens.\n\nThis gear had unmistakably fallen straight out of Teacher Gao's body!\n\nTheir omnipotent new homeroom teacher... was not human at all, ahhhhhh!!!\n"},{"id":3,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第三章：老師的字面理解症\n\n經歷了早上的「防人體扁平化皮尺量腰圍」事件後，整個六年一班陷入了一種前所未有的詭異氣氛中。\n\n阿釁的腰上還留著那條黃色工程皮尺勒過的紅印子。老巫則一臉肉痛地看著自己只咬了兩口的高麗菜肉包——剛才在高老師那雙閃爍著威嚴光芒的黑框眼鏡注視下，他硬生生把剩下的肉包全塞進了阿釁嘴裡。\n\n「嗚嗚……我的特級高麗菜黑豬肉包……」老巫趴在桌上小聲啜泣。\n\n「你哭屁啊！差點被噎死的人是我好不好！」阿釁猛灌了一大口開水，心有餘悸地壓低聲音。\n\n這時，綝耘晴把椅子往前挪了半公分，從筆袋裡掏出一個高倍率的微型放大鏡。\n\n「阿釁，把剛才那東西拿出來。」晴晴神情凝重地命令道。\n\n阿釁鬼鬼祟祟地四下張望了一圈，確認講台上的高老師正在以每秒改五本作業的神速「刷刷刷」批改國習，這才悄悄從球鞋底層摸出了那顆冰涼的黃銅齒輪。\n\n晴晴接過齒輪，湊在放大鏡下一看，倒抽了一口涼氣。\n\n「鈦合金硬化鍍層、二十四齒行星減速結構、微米級精密加工……」晴晴喃喃自語，雙眼亮得像兩顆小燈泡，「這種精密度，連我爸店裡最頂級的進口重機引擎都比不上！這絕對不是普通手錶或玩具的零件！」\n\n「那到底是啥？」老巫湊過來問。\n\n「中心刻著微縮編號：【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「而且，你們剛才看到高老師眼鏡鏡片上的提示字了嗎？那串字寫著：『常識與修辭調節器離線』！」\n\n阿釁一愣：「常識與修辭……調節器？」\n\n就在三個腦袋湊在一起竊竊私語時，天花板通風口傳來極輕微的「吱吱」爪子聲。\n\n一撮雪白的小絨毛從通風柵欄裡探了出來。AI 小寵物「溜溜」的小腦袋露在外面，耳朵上的兩根微型天線滴溜溜直轉，對著三人發出極低頻率的電子語音：\n\n「嗶……偵測到目標移動……距離五公尺……請各單位注意隱蔽……」\n\n「啪！」\n\n晴晴光速收起齒輪與放大鏡。\n\n下一秒，一道挺拔如松的身影無聲無息地出現在三人課桌旁。\n\n高峙舷老師低頭看著他們。西裝依然筆挺，頭髮依然連一根都沒亂，但如果仔細看的話，他左側眼角的肌肉似乎正以極微小的頻率抽搐著，發出像電子錶走針一樣的「嗒、嗒」聲。\n\n「轆慄釁同學、綝耘晴同學、巫茞輆同學。」\n\n高老師平靜地開口，聲線裡帶著一種微妙的金屬混音：「早自習時間，禁止聚集進行超過四十分貝的聲波震動。此外，本人的紅外線熱成像儀顯示，你們三人的心跳速率分別為每分鐘一百一十二下、一百零八下與九十五下，呈現典型的『密謀惡作劇』生理體徵。」\n\n阿釁冷汗都下來了。\n\n連心跳都能量？！這已經不是人體雷達了，這是行動式測謊機啊！\n\n為了轉移話題，坐在隔壁排的體育生陳阿達剛好打完球回教室，一屁股癱在椅子上，拿著墊板瘋狂搧風，大聲嚷嚷：\n\n「哇靠！今天外面太陽好大，教室熱得像烤箱一樣！」\n\n「唰！」\n\n高老師猛然轉身，鏡片瞬間閃爍起一圈醒目的黃色微光。\n\n`[LITERAL MODE TRIGGERED: 教室 = 烤箱 (Oven)]`\n\n高老師的雙眼鎖定在教室牆壁上的溫度計：「環境感測確認：目前室溫攝氏二十八點五度。與標準旋風烤箱運行溫度（攝氏一百八十度至兩百二十度）存在顯著偏差。」\n\n他大步走向黑板邊的冷氣開關，一把拉下面板：\n\n「為了符合同學陳述之『烤箱』工作環境，即刻關閉電風扇，並準備對全班進行均勻烘烤。請各位保持坐姿端正，每隔十分鐘自行翻面一次，以確保受熱均勻，避免表皮焦黑。」\n\n全班：「？？？？？？？？？」\n\n「老、老師！他是比喻！比喻啊！」阿釁急得從椅子上跳了起來。\n\n「本系統……咳，本人的常識資料庫處於未掛載狀態，無法識別『比喻』。」高老師一本正經地站在講台上，甚至認真地拿出計時器，「烘烤倒數計時開始。陳阿達同學，你的後頸顏色偏淺，建議先翻面。」\n\n陳阿達嚇得直接從椅子上滑倒在地上，連滾帶爬地抱住課桌大叫：「老師我錯了！教室不是烤箱！教室很涼！非常涼爽！」\n\n高老師眼中閃過一串代碼，計時器發出「叮」的一聲收回口袋：\n\n「陳述修正為『涼爽』。烘烤取消。」\n\n全班二十六個人集體擦了一把冷汗。坐在後排的幾個男生忍不住捂著肚子低頭狂笑，笑聲在安靜的教室裡格外刺耳。\n\n其中一個男生笑得直拍桌子：「哈哈哈哈哈！太扯了！老師你太搞笑了，我快笑掉大牙了啦！」\n\n這話一出，阿釁和晴晴臉色瞬間大變！\n\n「等一下！不要說那個詞——」晴晴尖叫著想要阻止。\n\n但太遲了。\n\n高老師的瞳孔猛地一縮，機械延遲音再次拔高了半個音調：\n\n`[EMERGENCY DENTAL HAZARD DETECTED: 脫牙預警]`\n\n「牙齒即將發生非受控脫落事件！」\n\n高老師身形一閃，宛如武俠片裡的輕功高手，瞬間位移到了那個大笑的男生桌前。\n\n「唰！」\n\n只見高老師雙手在西裝口袋裡一掏，竟然掏出了一捲醫用牙線、一小瓶抗過敏漱口水，以及一把看起來極其專業的金屬鑷子！\n\n「尪伝恺同學，張開下顎，露出門牙與臼齒。」\n\n高老師的神情嚴肅得像急診室的主刀醫師：「本老師擁有三千小時模擬牙科手術經驗。在牙齒徹底掉落前，我將使用高拉力牙線對你的全口三十二顆牙齒進行十字交叉加固，確保笑聲震動頻率不超過琺瑯質耐受極限！」\n\n「哇啊啊啊啊！老師不要啊！我的牙齒很牢固！一顆都沒掉！你看——全部都在啊！」尪伝恺嚇得雙手死死捂住嘴巴，眼淚都快飆出來了。\n\n「嘴唇緊閉妨礙檢查。將啟動強制牽引器。」高老師舉起了金屬鑷子。\n\n就在這個千鈞一髮的混亂時刻——\n\n「吱吱！咻——！」\n\n一道銀白色的影子從講台頂部如閃電般疾馳而下！\n\n是溜溜！\n\n溜溜精準無比地撲向講台旁邊的總電源箱，小尾巴啪的一甩，直接拍在下課鈴聲的測試按鈕上！\n\n「鐺——鐺——鐺——鐺——」\n\n清脆高亢的下課鐘聲提前了五分鐘在整棟教學大樓猛然響起！\n\n高老師的動作猛地一頓。\n\n他眼中的黃光瞬間跳轉回平靜的淡藍色。\n\n`[SCHEDULE OVERRIDE: 下課鐘聲判定生效]`\n`[Priority: 牙科手術暫停，進入下課休憩模式]`\n\n高老師收起鑷子與牙線，優雅地整了整領帶，彷彿剛才要拔人家牙齒的人完全不是他一樣，語調溫和地說道：\n\n「下課時間已到。尪伝恺同學，請保持牙床靜態，下堂課我們繼續牙齒固定程序。」\n\n說完，高老師踩著精準的七十五公分步伐，轉身走出教室，朝著辦公室方向走去。\n\n「呼……」\n\n尪伝恺整個人癱軟在地上，褲螄差點被嚇濕。\n\n全班同學這才如釋重負地大口喘氣，一個個像是剛從鬼門關走了一遭。\n\n阿釁、晴晴、老巫立刻圍到了黑板後面。溜溜從牆縫裡探出毛茸茸的腦袋，一對尖耳朵抖了抖，得意的揚起小鬍鬚。\n\n「溜溜，幹得太漂亮了！」阿釁揉了揉溜溜的小腦袋。\n\n晴晴神色無比凝重地壓低聲音：「情況比我想像的還要嚴重。缺少了那顆黃銅齒輪，高老師的系統正在把所有的日常修辭都當成物理指令來執行！」\n\n老巫打了個哆嗦：「要是下次有人說『我想打斷你的狗腿』……老師會不會真的去打斷隔壁校犬的腿啊？！」\n\n「很有可能！」晴晴咬牙道，「而且你們看他剛才的動作，他的手臂轉動時有金屬風扇的嗡鳴聲。他快要過熱了！」\n\n阿釁握緊了口袋裡那顆沉甸甸的【Core-Gear #03】，眼中燃起了一股前所未有的冒險光芒：\n\n「今天放學後，我們不能讓他一個人待著。溜溜負責在通風管追蹤他的動向，我們三個去堵他——六年一班的秘密行動，正式開始！」\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 3: Teacher's Literal Interpretation Syndrome\n\nFollowing the morning's \"anti-human-flattening tape-measure waist check\" incident, the entirety of Class 6-1 fell into an unprecedentedly bizarre atmosphere.\n\nThe red welt left by the tight yellow engineering tape measure still marked A-Xin's waist. Old Wu, meanwhile, stared with heartbroken anguish at his cabbage pork bun, of which he had only taken two bites—earlier, under the intense gaze of Teacher Gao's black-framed glasses glinting with terrifying authority, he had been forced to shove the entire remainder of the bun into A-Xin's mouth.\n\n\"Ugh... my special deluxe cabbage black pork bun...\" Old Wu whimpered softly, slumping over his desk.\n\n\"What are you crying for! I'm the one who almost choked to death, alright?!\" A-Xin gulped down a huge mouthful of water, his voice lowered with lingering fear.\n\nAt this moment, Lin Yunqing shifted her chair forward half a centimeter, retrieving a high-magnification miniature magnifying glass from her pencil case.\n\n\"A-Xin, take that thing out from earlier,\" Qingqing ordered with an intensely solemn expression.\n\nA-Xin looked around furtively, making sure that Teacher Gao on the podium was grading workbooks at a lightning speed of five copies per second, before quietly fishing the chilly brass gear out from the bottom of his sneaker.\n\nQingqing took the gear, peered through the magnifying glass, and gasped sharply.\n\n\"Titanium-alloy hardening coat, twenty-four-tooth planetary reduction structure, micrometer-level precision machining...\" Qingqing mumbled to herself, her eyes shining like bright lightbulbs. \"This level of craftsmanship surpasses even the top-tier imported superbikes in my dad's garage! This is definitely not a part from an ordinary watch or toy!\"\n\n\"Then what on earth is it?\" Old Wu leaned in to ask.\n\n\"Engraved in the center is a microscopic code: 【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"Moreover, did you guys see the prompt on Teacher Gao's glasses lenses earlier? It clearly read: 'Common-Sense and Rhetoric Damper Offline'!\"\n\nA-Xin was taken aback: \"Common-Sense and Rhetoric... Damper?\"\n\nWhile the three heads huddled together in hushed whispers, a faint scratching of claws came from the ceiling vent.\n\nA tuft of snow-white fluff poked out from between the vent slats. The AI pet \"Liu-Liu\" leaned its little head forward, the two miniature antennae on its ears spinning in circles, transmitting an ultra-low-frequency electronic voice to the trio:\n\n\"Beep... target movement detected... distance five meters... all units take cover...\"\n\n\"Snap!\"\n\nQingqing concealed the gear and magnifying glass at the speed of light.\n\nThe next second, a posture as upright as a pine tree appeared soundlessly beside their desks.\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian looked down at them. His suit remained impeccable, not a single strand of hair out of place, but upon closer inspection, the muscle near the corner of his left eye seemed to twitch with a microscopic frequency, emitting a rhythmic \"tap, tap\" like the second hand of an electronic watch.\n\n\"Student Lu Lixin, Student Lin Yunqing, Student Wu Chenkai.\"\n\nTeacher Gao spoke calmly, his tone carrying a faint metallic undertone: \"During morning self-study, gathering to produce sound waves exceeding forty decibels is prohibited. Furthermore, my infrared thermal imaging shows your three heart rates at 112, 108, and 95 beats per minute respectively, exhibiting typical physiological indicators of 'conspiring a prank.'\"\n\nCold sweat instantly beaded across A-Xin's forehead.\n\nHe could even measure heart rates?! This wasn't just human radar; this was a walking polygraph machine!\n\nTo change the subject, the athletic student Chen Ada from the adjacent aisle happened to return from playing basketball, collapsing into his chair, fanning himself furiously with a plastic desk mat, and yelling loudly:\n\n\"Whoa! The sun outside is scorching today! The classroom is as hot as an oven!\"\n\n\"Swish!\"\n\nTeacher Gao turned abruptly, a noticeable halo of yellow light flashing across his lenses.\n\n`[LITERAL MODE TRIGGERED: Classroom = Oven]`\n\nTeacher Gao's eyes locked onto the thermometer on the classroom wall: \"Environmental sensor confirmation: Current ambient temperature is 28.5 degrees Celsius. A significant deviation exists compared to the operating temperature of a standard convection oven (180 to 220 degrees Celsius).\"\n\nStriding toward the air conditioner panel beside the blackboard, he yanked the power switch down:\n\n\"To conform to the 'oven' working conditions stated by the student, the fans are immediately deactivated, and uniform baking of the entire class shall commence. Please maintain upright posture and flip yourselves over every ten minutes to ensure even heat distribution and avoid charred skin.\"\n\nThe entire class: \"???????????\"\n\n\"T-Teacher! That was a metaphor! A figure of speech!\" A-Xin leaped up from his chair in panic.\n\n\"This system... ahem, my common-sense database is currently unmounted and cannot identify 'metaphors.'\" Teacher Gao stood on the podium with absolute earnestness, even deliberately pulling out a timer. \"Baking countdown initiated. Student Chen Ada, your nape coloration is relatively pale; flipping over first is recommended.\"\n\nChen Ada was so terrified that he slid directly out of his chair onto the floor, scrambling on all fours to hug his desk leg, screaming: \"Teacher, I was wrong! The classroom isn't an oven! It's cool! Extremely cool!\"\n\nA stream of code flashed across Teacher Gao's eyes, and the timer snapped back into his pocket with a \"ding\":\n\n\"Statement revised to 'cool.' Baking canceled.\"\n\nAll twenty-six students wiped away cold sweat in unison. Sitting in the back row, several boys couldn't hold back their laughter, clutching their bellies and snickering, the sound ringing particularly loud in the quiet classroom.\n\nOne of the boys slapped his desk and laughed uproariously: \"Hahahahaha! That's absurd! Teacher, you're hilarious, I'm laughing my big teeth off!\"\n\nUpon hearing those words, the faces of A-Xin and Qingqing changed drastically!\n\n\"Wait! Don't say that phrase—\" Qingqing screamed in an attempt to stop him.\n\nToo late.\n\nTeacher Gao's pupils contracted sharply, his mechanical latency rising by half an octave:\n\n`[EMERGENCY DENTAL HAZARD DETECTED: Imminent Tooth Loss Warning]`\n\n\"Uncontrolled tooth detachment event imminent!\"\n\nWith a blur of motion akin to a kung fu master, Teacher Gao instantly teleported directly in front of the laughing boy's desk.\n\n\"Swish!\"\n\nTeacher Gao reached into his suit pockets with both hands, astonishingly producing a spool of medical dental floss, a small bottle of desensitizing mouthwash, and a pair of professional-looking metallic forceps!\n\n\"Student Wang Zhuankai, open your mandible and reveal your incisors and molars.\"\n\nTeacher Gao's demeanor was as solemn as a chief surgeon in an emergency room: \"This teacher possesses three thousand hours of simulated dental surgery experience. Before teeth detachment occurs, I will use high-tensile dental floss to execute crisscross stabilization across all thirty-two of your teeth, ensuring the vibrational frequency of your laughter does not exceed enamel tolerance limits!\"\n\n\"Waaah! Teacher, don't! My teeth are rock solid! Not a single one came loose! Look—they're all right here!\" Wang Zhuankai clasped both hands tightly over his mouth in sheer panic, tears welling up in his eyes.\n\n\"Clenched lips obstruct examination. Forced retractor deployment engaged.\" Teacher Gao raised the metallic forceps.\n\nAt this critical, chaotic second—\n\n\"Squeak! Whoosh—!\"\n\nA silver-white shadow darted down from atop the blackboard like a lightning bolt!\n\nIt was Liu-Liu!\n\nWith pinpoint precision, Liu-Liu pounced onto the main electrical panel beside the podium, swinging its little tail with a slap directly against the dismissal bell testing button!\n\n\"Chime—chime—chime—chime—\"\n\nThe clear, loud end-of-period bell suddenly rang out across the entire teaching building five minutes ahead of schedule!\n\nTeacher Gao's movements paused abruptly.\n\nThe yellow glow in his eyes instantly transitioned back to a serene, pale blue.\n\n`[SCHEDULE OVERRIDE: Dismissal Bell Confirmed]`\n`[Priority: Dental surgery suspended; entering recess rest mode]`\n\nTeacher Gao stowed away the forceps and dental floss, elegantly straightening his necktie as if the person who had just tried to extract teeth wasn't him at all, speaking in a gentle tone:\n\n\"Recess has commenced. Student Wang Zhuankai, please maintain periodontal stillness; we shall resume the dental stabilization procedure next period.\"\n\nWith that, Teacher Gao stepped forward with precise seventy-five-centimeter strides, turned out of the classroom, and walked toward the faculty office.\n\n\"Phew...\"\n\nWang Zhuankai collapsed into a puddle on the floor, having nearly wet himself in terror.\n\nOnly then did the entire class heave sighs of immense relief, panting heavily as if they had just survived a brush with death.\n\nA-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu immediately clustered behind the blackboard. Liu-Liu poked its furry head out from the wall crevice, twitching its pointed ears and proudly raising its tiny whiskers.\n\n\"Liu-Liu, brilliant job!\" A-Xin rubbed Liu-Liu's little head.\n\nQingqing lowered her voice with extreme gravity: \"The situation is far worse than I imagined. Without that brass gear, Teacher Gao's system is interpreting every daily figure of speech as a literal physical command!\"\n\nOld Wu shuddered: \"If someone says 'I want to break your dog legs' next time... will Teacher really go out and break the campus stray dog's legs?!\"\n\n\"Quite likely!\" Qingqing gritted her teeth. \"And did you see his movements earlier? When his arms swung, there was the humming sound of a metallic cooling fan. He's on the verge of overheating!\"\n\nA-Xin clutched the heavy 【Core-Gear #03】 in his pocket, a spark of unprecedented adventurous excitement igniting in his eyes:\n\n\"After school today, we can't leave him alone. Liu-Liu will track his movements via the vents, and the three of us will intercept him—Class 6-1's secret operation officially begins!\"\n"},{"id":4,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第四章：器材室的祕密手術\n\n下午四點半，鹿陽國小的放學鐘聲響徹校園。\n\n夕陽將操場上的單槓拉出長長的影子。學生們背著書包三三兩兩走出校門，然而六年一班的三名核心幹部外加一隻AI小寵物，卻神神秘秘地潛伏在體育器材室外面的大榕樹下。\n\n「溜溜，目標在哪裡？」阿釁壓低聲音問。\n\n蹲在阿釁肩膀上的溜溜鼻尖聳動，兩隻狐狸尖耳靈敏地轉動著，隨後「嗖」地跳上窗台，小爪子在生鏽的百葉窗縫隙輕輕扒開一條縫，回頭對三人點了點頭。\n\n阿釁、晴晴和老巫連忙貓著腰湊上去。\n\n透過百葉窗的縫隙，器材室內部的景象讓三個人瞬間屏住了呼吸——\n\n只見高峙舷老師獨自坐在幾疊厚厚的跳箱上。他的西裝外套已經脫了下來，白襯衫的扣子敞開，露出了結實的胸膛。\n\n然而，那根本不是人類的肌肉！\n\n在高老師的胸骨正中央，竟然嵌著一塊散發著微光的蜂巢狀碳纖維散熱面板。此刻，面板正「嗡——嗡——」地高速旋轉著兩具超微型散熱風扇，大量溫熱的白色水蒸氣伴隨著細微的齒輪磨損聲，正不斷從他的後頸散發出來。\n\n而在他的右手小臂上，一塊仿生皮膚竟像車蓋一樣掀開著，露出了底下錯綜複雜的彩色微光光纖和發光晶片！\n\n「天啊……」晴晴兩眼放光，激動得差點把臉貼在窗玻璃上，「真正的神經光纖匯流排！還有奈米液冷散熱循環管！這到底是哪個神級實驗室打造出來的傑作啊？！」\n\n「晴晴，現在不是崇拜科技的時候！」阿釁扯了扯她的衣角，「你看老師的表情！」\n\n高老師坐在跳箱上，黑框眼鏡被隨意摘放在一旁。他的雙眼緊閉，眉頭緊蹙，嘴角微微抽動著，發出斷斷續續的機械電子音：\n\n`[Diagnostic: 溫度過高 (Core Temp: 78°C)]`\n`[Logical Conflict: 學生＝易碎碳基生物；教育法規＝嚴禁過度烘烤]`\n`[Warning: #03 行星齒輪遺失，平衡軸負載超標 340%……建議立即向 P.E.D.A. 總部發送回收請求……]`\n\n說到「向總部發送回收請求」時，高老師右手的微型伺服馬達突然停滯了一下，整個人陷入了短暫的休眠假死狀態。\n\n「他要叫總部把他回收了！」老巫嚇得抱住頭，「那怎麼行！要是換一個新老師來，誰幫我加熱肉包啊？！」\n\n「老巫你腦子裡只有肉包嗎！」阿釁沒好氣地敲了他一下，隨後看向晴晴：「晴晴，妳剛才說妳會修重機，這台『高老師』……妳能搞定嗎？」\n\n晴晴俐落地從後背包拉開拉鍊，唰地展開了一整套閃閃發光的精密修錶起子與絕緣鑷子。\n\n「重機和機器人的基本力學原理是一樣的！只要他不放電把我電焦，我就能修！」晴晴自信地揚起下巴。\n\n「好！行動！」\n\n阿釁輕輕推開器材室那扇長年沒鎖好的側門。\n\n「吱呀——」\n\n門軸發出刺耳的摩擦聲。休眠中的高老師猛地睜開雙眼！\n\n眼底深處瞬間掠過一道警惕的紅光：\n\n「警告：非授權人員闖入。防衛防衛機制準備啟……」\n\n「老師！等等！別防衛！是我們！」阿釁連忙舉起雙手，掌心赫然握著那顆閃爍著暗金色光芒的【Core-Gear #03】！\n\n看到那顆齒輪的瞬間，高老師眼中的紅光戛然而止。\n\n橘黃色的文字再次在他的瞳孔上瀑布般刷新：\n\n`[Target Object: #03 Common-Sense Damper 尋獲]`\n`[Host Identity: 轆慄釁同學]`\n`[Status: 威脅等級降為零]`\n\n高老師眼中的光芒恢復成了柔和的淡藍色，他緩緩放下了抬起的機械手臂，神情略帶疑惑地看著三個孩子和溜溜：\n\n「轆慄釁同學、綝耘晴同學、巫茞輆同學……校規第四十七條，放學後未經許可禁止在體育器材室逗留。還有，你們手裡拿著本人的核心組件。」\n\n「高老師，我們都知道了。」\n\n阿釁走上前，把齒輪遞到高老師面前：「你不是普通的人類老師，對不對？」\n\n高老師沉默了。\n\n器材室裡只有微型風扇旋轉的「嗡嗡」聲，以及窗外漸漸西沉的蟬鳴。\n\n過了許久，高老師才發出了一聲低沉而平緩的嘆息。那是經過精密演算法模擬的人類嘆息，卻透著一股說不出的落寞。\n\n「是的。本人的原廠型號為 GS-X01，全功能仿生教育試驗機器人。隸屬於先端未來科技與教育部的秘密試行專案。」\n\n高老師平靜地注視著三個孩子：「原本的程式設定，是讓本人展現出毫無瑕疵的完美教學能力，成為全縣的示範標竿。但今天早晨，因為三號行星齒輪脫落，導致『人類常識理解模組』損壞。」\n\n「所以你才會叫大家在教室均勻翻面烘烤，還要拔尪伝恺的牙齒？」老巫忍不住插嘴。\n\n高老師的耳根處泛起了一圈微紅——那是散熱不良的訊號，但也奇妙地像人類在害羞：「那是邏輯回退模式下的非受控運算錯誤。按照專案協定，一旦機器人發生一級機能故障且無法自修，必須在二十四小時內發送信號，由總部回收銷毀，並格式化所有資料庫。」\n\n「格式化？！」晴晴驚叫道，「那你不就等於『死掉』了嗎？你所有的記憶、認識我們的事……都會全部不見？！」\n\n「在資料學上，那被稱為『恢復出廠設定』。」高老師平靜地說道，「但我無法否認……在今天的異常日誌裡，六年一班的資料權重，已經被演算法標記為『不可替代』。」\n\n阿釁咬了咬牙，大步跨上前，一把奪過晴晴手裡的微型螺絲起子塞給她：\n\n「什麼格式化！我們才不要讓你被抓回去拆成廢鐵！晴晴，動手！」\n\n「好！」晴晴毫不猶豫地挽起袖子，戴上防靜電手環，熟練地蹲在高老師身後。\n\n「等等！綝耘晴同學，未經工程師認證，隨意拆卸將導致……痛！那裡是後頸冷卻液閥門，不要用一字起子硬撬！」\n\n「閉嘴啦老師！我爸教過我，只要卡榫卡住，敲兩下就通了！」晴晴拿著膠槌在散熱外殼上「咚咚」敲了兩下，高老師的眼鏡鏡片瞬間彈出三個亂碼視窗。\n\n「阿釁，把齒輪拿好！老巫，拿手電筒照著！溜溜，去門口盯梢！」晴晴雷厲風行地下達指令。\n\n溜溜「吱」的一聲敬了個禮，身形一閃跳上通風口，化身最敬業的警報雷達。\n\n器材室裡，夕陽的金光穿過窗欞，照耀在專注的孩子們與滿身零件的仿生老師身上。\n\n雖然晴晴的技術有點野蠻、雖然老巫緊張得差點把肉包渣掉進主機板、雖然阿釁遞螺絲時手心全都是汗——\n\n但當那顆【Core-Gear #03】終於「喀噠」一聲咬合回原位時，高老師眼中的橘黃色亂碼瞬間消散，轉化為一抹清澈明亮的幽藍。\n\n「組件咬合完成度：百分之九十五。」\n\n高老師深吸了一口氣，胸口的風扇緩緩合攏，仿生皮膚平整復原。他重新戴上黑框眼鏡，注視著眼前滿手黑油、灰頭土臉的三個學生。\n\n「你們包庇了重大安全瑕疵品，違反了誠實守則。」高老師語調嚴肅地說。\n\n阿釁咧嘴一笑：「那老師，你要扣我們的操行分數嗎？」\n\n高老師的鏡片閃爍了一下，嘴角微微彎起一個打破演算法限制的、極其真實的微笑：\n\n「不。根據修正後的最高核心指令——」\n\n「六年一班，全員結盟成功。」\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 4: Secret Surgery in the Equipment Room\n\nAt 4:30 in the afternoon, the dismissal bell of Luyang Elementary School echoed across the campus.\n\nThe setting sun cast elongated shadows of the horizontal bars across the athletic field. Carrying their backpacks, students strolled out of the school gates in groups of two and three. However, the three core leaders of Class 6-1, along with their AI smart pet, were lurking mysteriously beneath the massive banyan tree outside the physical education equipment room.\n\n\"Liu-Liu, where is the target?\" A-Xin whispered in a low voice.\n\nPerched on A-Xin's shoulder, Liu-Liu's little snout twitched as its two pointed fox ears turned alertly. With a whoosh, it leaped onto the windowsill, its tiny paws gently nudging open a slit in the rusted Venetian blinds, turning back to nod toward the trio.\n\nA-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu quickly crouched low and pressed close.\n\nPeeking through the crack of the blinds, the scene inside the equipment room caused the three of them to hold their breath in an instant—\n\nThere sat Teacher Gao Zhixian alone upon several stacked gym vaulting boxes. His suit jacket was removed, and the buttons of his white dress shirt were unfastened, revealing a sturdy chest.\n\nHowever, that was by no means human muscle!\n\nAt the dead center of Teacher Gao's sternum was an embedded, faintly glowing honeycomb-shaped carbon-fiber cooling panel. At this moment, two ultra-miniature cooling fans on the panel were spinning furiously with an intense humming sound: \"Bzzzz—bzzzz—\" A thick plume of warm, white water vapor, accompanied by faint sounds of grinding gears, billowed continuously from the nape of his neck.\n\nMeanwhile, on his right forearm, a flap of bionic skin had flipped open like the hood of a car, exposing an intricate maze of multicolored glowing optical fibers and luminous microchips underneath!\n\n\"Good heavens...\" Qingqing's eyes gleamed as she pressed her face eagerly against the windowpane. \"A real neural optical-fiber bus! And nano-liquid cooling heat-dissipation circulation pipes! Which god-tier laboratory engineered such an absolute masterpiece?!\"\n\n\"Qingqing, this isn't the time to nerd out over technology!\" A-Xin tugged her sleeve. \"Look at Teacher's face!\"\n\nSitting atop the vaulting boxes, Teacher Gao's black-framed glasses were casually laid aside. His eyes were clamped shut, his brow tightly furrowed, the corners of his mouth twitching faintly as intermittent mechanical-electronic audio crackled out:\n\n`[Diagnostic: Thermal Overload (Core Temp: 78°C)]`\n`[Logical Conflict: Students = Fragile Carbon-Based Organisms; Education Regulations = Excessive Baking Prohibited]`\n`[Warning: #03 Planetary Gear Missing; Balance Axis Load Exceeds 340%... Immediate Reclamation Request to P.E.D.A. HQ Recommended...]`\n\nThe moment the phrase \"Reclamation Request to P.E.D.A. HQ\" was uttered, the miniature servomotor in Teacher Gao's right arm suddenly stalled, plunging him into a brief, suspended-animation state of sleep.\n\n\"He's about to ask headquarters to scrap him!\" Old Wu clutched his head in sheer panic. \"We can't let that happen! If a new teacher comes, who's going to heat up my pork buns?!\"\n\n\"Old Wu, is there nothing in your head except pork buns!\" A-Xin whacked him exasperatedly, then turned to Qingqing: \"Qingqing, you said you know how to fix heavy motorcycles. This 'Teacher Gao'... can you handle him?\"\n\nQingqing briskly unzipped her backpack, flourishing a whole set of gleaming, precision watchmaking screwdrivers and insulated tweezers with a dramatic swish.\n\n\"The fundamental mechanical principles of motorcycles and robots are the same! As long as he doesn't zap me into a crisp with an electric discharge, I can fix him!\" Qingqing raised her chin with complete confidence.\n\n\"Alright! Let's move!\"\n\nA-Xin gently pushed open the long-unlocked side door of the equipment room.\n\n\"Creak—\"\n\nThe door hinge gave a grating screech. In suspended animation, Teacher Gao snapped his eyes open!\n\nA wary crimson light flashed deep within his pupils:\n\n\"Warning: Unauthorized personnel intrusion. Defensive measures preparing to acti—\"\n\n\"Teacher! Wait! Don't activate! It's us!\" A-Xin hastily held up both hands, his palm visibly clutching that dark-golden gleaming 【Core-Gear #03】!\n\nThe instant the gear entered his field of vision, the red light in Teacher Gao's eyes came to an abrupt halt.\n\nOrange-yellow text cascaded like a waterfall across his pupils once again:\n\n`[Target Object: #03 Common-Sense Damper Acquired]`\n`[Host Identity: Student Lu Lixin]`\n`[Status: Threat Level Reduced to Zero]`\n\nThe glow in Teacher Gao's eyes softened back to a serene, pale blue. He slowly lowered his raised mechanical arm, looking at the three children and Liu-Liu with a tinge of perplexity:\n\n\"Student Lu Lixin, Student Lin Yunqing, Student Wu Chenkai... School Rule Number 47: Loitering in the sports equipment room after school without permission is forbidden. Furthermore, you are holding my core component.\"\n\n\"Teacher Gao, we know everything.\"\n\nA-Xin stepped forward, holding the gear out before Teacher Gao: \"You aren't a regular human teacher, are you?\"\n\nTeacher Gao fell silent.\n\nInside the equipment room, there was only the faint humming of the micro-fans spinning and the sound of cicadas fading outside the window in the sunset.\n\nAfter a long time, Teacher Gao let out a low, slow sigh. It was a sigh simulated through sophisticated algorithms, yet it carried an indescribable sense of melancholy.\n\n\"Yes. My factory model designation is GS-X01, an omnipotent bionic educational trial robot. Part of a secret pilot project between Advanced Future Technology and the Ministry of Education.\"\n\nTeacher Gao looked calmly at the three children: \"My original programming was to demonstrate flawless, textbook-perfect teaching capabilities and become a benchmark model for the entire county. But this morning, because planetary gear number three fell out, my 'Human Common Sense Interpretation Module' was compromised.\"\n\n\"So that's why you told everyone to flip themselves over like baked bread and tried to pull Wang Zhuankai's teeth?\" Old Wu couldn't help interjecting.\n\nA subtle blush crept over the edges of Teacher Gao's ears—a byproduct of poor thermal dissipation, yet peculiarly resembling a human feeling embarrassed: \"Those were uncontrolled computation errors under logic-fallback mode. According to project protocol, whenever a robot experiences a Level-1 functional failure that cannot be self-repaired, a signal must be transmitted within twenty-four hours for headquarters to reclaim, scrap, and format all databases.\"\n\n\"Formatted?!\" Qingqing cried out in shock. \"Doesn't that mean you'll basically 'die'?! All your memories, all your experiences knowing us... will completely disappear?!\"\n\n\"In data science, that is referred to as 'factory reset,'\" Teacher Gao said calmly. \"Yet I cannot deny... in today's error logs, the data weighting of Class 6-1 has already been tagged by the algorithm as 'irreplaceable.'\"\n\nA-Xin gritted his teeth, took a stride forward, snatched the miniature screwdriver from Qingqing's hand, and thrust it back into her fingers:\n\n\"What formatting! We're not letting them haul you back and tear you down for scrap metal! Qingqing, do it!\"\n\n\"Right!\" Without hesitation, Qingqing rolled up her sleeves, snapped on an anti-static wristband, and squatted expertly behind Teacher Gao.\n\n\"Wait! Student Lin Yunqing, unauthorized disassembly without certified engineering credentials will result in... ouch! That is the nape coolant valve, do not pry it with a flathead screwdriver!\"\n\n\"Zip it, Teacher! My dad taught me that whenever a latch is stuck, tapping it twice fixes everything!\" Qingqing tapped twice on the cooling casing with a rubber mallet, causing three scrambled error windows to pop up instantly on Teacher Gao's glasses lenses.\n\n\"A-Xin, hold the gear tight! Old Wu, shine the flashlight right here! Liu-Liu, keep watch at the door!\" Qingqing barked commands like a seasoned commander.\n\nLiu-Liu gave a crisp \"squeak,\" saluted with its little paw, flashed onto the vent, and transformed into the most dedicated radar lookout.\n\nInside the equipment room, the golden rays of sunset sliced through the window slats, illuminating the focused children and their bionic teacher bristling with exposed hardware.\n\nAlthough Qingqing's technique was slightly rough-and-tumble, although Old Wu was so nervous he nearly dropped pork bun crumbs into the motherboard, and although A-Xin's palms were soaked with sweat as he handed over screws—\n\nWhen that 【Core-Gear #03】 finally snapped back into place with a definitive \"click,\" the orange-yellow scrambled text in Teacher Gao's eyes vanished in an instant, shifting into a clear, radiant hue of azure blue.\n\n\"Component engagement completion rate: 95 percent.\"\n\nTeacher Gao inhaled deeply. The fans on his chest slowly folded inward, and his bionic skin smoothed out to its seamless form. Putting his black-framed glasses back on, he gazed at the three soot-faced students whose hands were covered in black grease.\n\n\"You have harbored a major safety defective unit, violating the school's code of honesty,\" Teacher Gao stated with solemn composure.\n\nA-Xin grinned widely: \"So Teacher, are you going to deduct our conduct grade?\"\n\nTeacher Gao's lenses flickered slightly, and the corners of his mouth curved into a remarkably genuine smile that shattered algorithmic constraints:\n\n\"No. In accordance with the revised supreme core directive—\"\n\n\"Class 6-1, alliance successfully formed.\"\n"},{"id":5,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第五章：乾冰舞台劇大救援\n\n雖然昨天傍晚在體育器材室裡，綝耘晴用一把膠槌和精密螺絲起子，奇蹟似地把三號黃銅行星齒輪敲回了高老師的後頸，但「非官方暴力維修」終究留下了後遺症。\n\n一大早的綜合活動課，高峙舷老師站在講台上，西裝依然一絲不苟，領帶依然筆挺如尺。\n\n然而，坐在第一排的綝耘晴卻緊張得手心冒汗。\n\n因為每當高老師眨一下眼睛，他的黑框眼鏡鏡片右下角，就會跳出一排極小的黃色警告訊息：\n\n`[Thermal Warning: 液冷散熱循環阻力偏高]`\n`[Core Temperature: 68°C... 72°C... 上升中]`\n\n「各位六年一班的同學，」高老師語調平靜地開口，但嗓音深處隱隱夾雜著像是開水壺即將煮沸前的低沉鳴音，「今日綜合活動課的主題為『多工邏輯與問題解決』。本老師將同時接受全班二十六名同學提出二十六個不同學科的難題，並在五秒鐘內同時給予最佳解。」\n\n「老師，不要勉強啊！」阿釁嚇得在座位上小聲喊道。\n\n但全班同學顯然還沒意識到危機，紛紛興奮地舉手搶問：\n\n「老師！光年到底怎麼換算成台斤？」\n「老師！為什麼企鵝的腳不會凍傷？！」\n「老師！老巫一餐吃八個肉包，一年會消耗掉幾座養豬場？！」\n\n「問題數據接收完畢。運算核心全開——」\n\n高老師話音剛落，雙眼瞬間爆發出刺眼的璀璨藍光！\n\n他那顆超導仿生處理器開始以每秒數十億次的極限速度狂飆。然而，被暴力敲回原位的齒輪似乎卡住了排氣閥門——\n\n「滋——滋——滋——！！」\n\n一聲尖銳刺耳的氣閥洩壓聲在教室前方驟然炸響！\n\n只見高老師梳得油光水滑的黑色西裝頭頂上，猛然「噗」的一聲，噴出了一道碗口粗的濃白水蒸氣！\n\n「哇啊啊！冒煙了！老師的頭頂噴水蒸氣了！」老巫嚇得把手裡的肉包都捏扁了。\n\n大量滾燙純白的水蒸氣宛如火山爆發，源源不絕地從高老師的後頸與髮際線洶湧湧出，短短幾秒鐘內，整座講台瞬間被白茫茫的濃霧完全籠罩，甚至開始朝著第一排學生的課桌急速漫延！\n\n「運算……完成……」\n\n高老師站在濃霧正中央，整個人宛如仙境裡的得道仙人，說話時嘴巴還吐出兩道長長的小白煙：「企鵝的足部具備逆流熱交換系統……老巫一年將消耗一點二座養豬場……但……本機散熱系統已達極限……即將強制排氣……」\n\n「噗咻————！！」\n\n高老師頭頂的白煙噴得更猛了，簡直就像在教室裡直接引爆了一枚專業級的舞台乾冰煙霧彈！\n\n就在教室裡的二十六名學生嗆得直揉眼睛、場面即將徹底失控之際——\n\n天花板的通風管突然傳來一陣淒厲急促的電子警報！\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！一級警報！一級紅色警報！」\n\n只見一道雪白的身影從排氣孔電射而出，AI小寵物「溜溜」連滾帶爬地摔在阿釁的桌上，兩隻小狐狸耳朵瘋狂朝後轉動，黑曜石電子眼投射出走廊即時監控畫面：\n\n「黑面判官！學務主任周嚴手持紅色違規登記簿！距離後門僅剩十五公尺！十公尺！他聞到了燒焦味，正在朝本班狂奔！！」\n\n全班二十六個人的心臟瞬間跳到了嗓子眼！\n\n要是被黑面主任看到高老師頭頂像蒸汽火車一樣狂噴白煙，高老師是機器人的秘密當場就會曝光！科技公司的回收車最快今天下午就會把老師拖走大卸八塊！\n\n「怎麼辦？！窗戶打不開！煙太濃了根本散不掉啊！」老巫急得直跺腳。\n\n「既然散不掉——那就不要散！」\n\n關鍵時刻，阿釁的腦袋以超越常人的速度靈光一閃。\n\n他一腳踩上椅子，振臂高呼，聲音蓋過了白煙的呼嘯聲：「六年一班全體注意！啟動緊急應變——《白雪公主之森林迷霧》全班大匯演！晴晴，拉窗簾！老巫，拿掃把當長槍！尪伝恺，你去演白雪公主！」\n\n「哈？我演白雪公主？我是男生耶！」尪伝恺抗議。\n\n「廢話！全班就你皮膚最白！快把桌布披上！」阿釁一把扯下講台上的紅色防塵布套在尪伝恺頭上。\n\n整間教室瞬間動了起來！\n\n二十六名學生爆發出了前所未有的默契。晴晴唰地扯上深藍色窗簾，教室光線驟暗；兩名男生抓起拖把在濃霧中擺出中世紀騎士決鬥姿勢；老巫把黑色垃圾桶倒扣在頭上當魔鏡；而阿釁抓起一根竹掃把，神情無比莊嚴地站在濃霧前方的講桌上。\n\n就在最後一秒——\n\n「砰！！」\n\n教室後門被一股蠻力狠狠踹開！\n\n學務主任周嚴那張黝黑如鐵、宛如黑面判官的嚴肅面孔出現在門口。他手裡死死攥著違規紀錄本，眼神犀利得像兩把手術刀，正準備抓個現行：\n\n「六年一班！你們大白天在教室裡搞什麼鬼——」\n\n然而，周主任的話剛說到一半，就被眼前震撼人心的景象硬生生堵回了喉嚨裡。\n\n推開門的剎那，一股濃郁冰涼的白色迷霧如巨浪般從教室裡湧了出來，撲了他滿臉。\n\n在深邃幽暗的教室裡，濃煙滾滾、雲霧繚繞，宛如黑森林深處的仙境。\n\n講台最高處，高峙舷老師西裝筆挺地負手而立，頭頂源源不絕地散發著聖潔高貴的白煙，黑框眼鏡在迷霧中反射著清冽的寒光，氣場威嚴得像希臘神話裡的奧林匹斯山天神。\n\n而在高老師身旁，披著紅桌布的尪伝恺正楚楚可憐地咬著半顆蘋果，阿釁手握竹掃把，用莎士比亞舞台劇般的詠嘆調撕心裂肺地咆哮：\n\n「啊！迷霧籠罩了森林！毒蘋果穿透了靈魂！偉大的森林賢者高老師啊，請賜予這片土地最後的光明吧——！」\n\n頭戴垃圾桶的老巫立刻咚咚敲著鐵桶：「魔鏡啊魔鏡！誰才是世界上最帥的導師——！」\n\n全班二十六名同學同時在濃霧中單膝跪地，齊聲高呼：「高老師！高老師！高老師！」\n\n周主任整個人石化在門口。\n\n他那張萬年不笑的黑臉，此刻精彩得像是打翻的調色盤。\n\n「這……這是……」周主任用力吸了吸鼻子，皺眉打量著漫天的濃霧，「這煙是哪來的？你們哪來的經費買乾冰？！」\n\n全班同學的心跳瞬間漏了一拍。\n\n就在阿釁手心捏出冷汗的千鈞一髮之際——\n\n站在迷霧核心的高老師緩緩推了推眼鏡。\n\n他的核心運算終於降溫回到了安全閾值，頭頂的白煙驟然一縮，化作兩道優雅的細煙從耳後排氣孔排出。\n\n他轉過身，面無表情地俯視著周主任，語調沈穩莊重、毫無破綻：\n\n「報告周主任。本班正在為下個月全縣學生戲劇比賽進行沉浸式排練。此乃本人獨家研發的『奈米超音波常溫水霧氣氛模組』，百分之百環保無毒、安全無害。目的在於以最高擬真度激發學生的藝術共感神經。」\n\n周主任愣住了。\n\n他低頭看了看手裡的違規登記簿，又抬頭看了看滿屋子全神貫注、演技逼真的學生，最後目光落在滿身仙氣、深不可測的高老師身上。\n\n身為全校最古板的主任，他雖然覺得哪裡怪怪的，但不得不承認——這排練效果簡直堪比國家級國家劇院！\n\n「咳！咳嗯！」\n\n周主任尷尬地清了清喉嚨，收起了違規紀錄本，板著臉道：\n\n「胡鬧！排練歸排練……但身為六年級學生，升學與課業還是第一位！不過……這舞台霧氣特效確實做得很有水準。繼續保持，但下課前必須開窗通風！聽到沒有？！」\n\n「聽到了——謝謝主任——！！」全班扯開嗓門齊聲大吼。\n\n周主任滿意地點點頭，轉身踩著皮鞋大步離開了走廊。\n\n腳步聲剛消失在樓梯轉角——\n\n「呼——————！！！」\n\n整間教室瞬間像被抽乾了空氣一樣，二十六個學生集體癱倒在課桌上。\n\n尪伝恺一把扯下頭上的紅桌布，滿頭大汗：「媽呀……我剛才差點以為我要被記大過了！」\n\n老巫摘下頭上的垃圾桶，長長舒了一口氣，隨手擦去臉上的水氣。\n\n講台上的高老師低頭看著這群橫七豎八、滿頭冷汗的孩子們。\n\n他那雙藍色光芒漸漸柔和的瞳孔深處，核心日誌正無聲無息地刷新著一條前所未見的數據：\n\n`[System Log: 檢測到非邏輯性集體偽裝行為]`\n`[Event Description: 乾冰舞台劇大救援]`\n`[Teamwork Cohesion: 100% (極限滿值)]`\n`[Conclusion: 六年一班學生……確實具備超常之生命力]`\n\n高老師嘴角微微向上揚起，吐出最後一口極細微的白煙：\n\n「全員注意。戲劇表演結束——現在，把課本翻到第四十五頁，我們繼續上課。」\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 5: Dry-Ice Drama Rescue\n\nAlthough Lin Yunqing had miraculously hammered the number-three brass planetary gear back into Teacher Gao's nape yesterday evening in the sports equipment room using a rubber mallet and precision screwdrivers, \"unofficial brute-force maintenance\" inevitably left lingering aftereffects.\n\nDuring the morning integrated activities period, Teacher Gao Zhixian stood tall at the podium, his suit as impeccably pressed as ever and his tie as ruler-straight as ever.\n\nHowever, sitting in the front row, Lin Yunqing was so nervous that cold sweat slicked her palms.\n\nFor every time Teacher Gao blinked, a tiny string of yellow warning notices popped up in the lower-right corner of his black-framed glasses:\n\n`[Thermal Warning: Liquid Cooling Circulation Resistance High]`\n`[Core Temperature: 68°C... 72°C... Rising]`\n\n\"Dear students of Class 6-1,\" Teacher Gao began in an even tone, though deep within his voice there hummed an almost imperceptible, low whistle akin to a kettle on the verge of boiling, \"today's topic for integrated activities is 'Multitasking Logic and Problem Solving.' This teacher shall simultaneously accept twenty-six difficult questions across twenty-six different subjects from all twenty-six students, delivering optimal solutions for all concurrently within five seconds.\"\n\n\"Teacher, don't push yourself!\" A-Xin shouted in panic from his desk in a hushed voice.\n\nYet the rest of the class had clearly not realized the impending danger, excitedly raising their hands one after another to fire off queries:\n\n\"Teacher! How do you convert light-years into catties?!\"\n\"Teacher! Why don't penguins get frostbite on their feet?!\"\n\"Teacher! If Old Wu eats eight pork buns a meal, how many pig farms will he devour in a year?!\"\n\n\"Question data intake complete. Computational core running at full throttle—\"\n\nThe moment Teacher Gao's words landed, a blinding burst of azure light erupted from his eyes!\n\nHis superconductive bionic processor began redlining at the extreme rate of tens of billions of operations per second. Unfortunately, the gear that had been violently hammered into place seemed to have jammed the exhaust valve—\n\n\"Sizzle—sizzle—sizzle—!!\"\n\nA piercing, shrieking sound of a pressure valve venting tore through the front of the classroom!\n\nAtop Teacher Gao's slick, neatly parted black-haired head, there was a sudden \"poof,\" and a dense plume of pure white steam as thick as a bowl shot straight into the air!\n\n\"Waaah! Smoke! Teacher's head is spewing steam!\" Old Wu was so terrified he squished the pork bun in his hand into mush.\n\nMassive billows of scalding, snow-white water vapor poured out like an erupting volcano, endlessly gushing from the nape of Teacher Gao's neck and hairline. Within mere seconds, the entire podium was completely engulfed in a swirling white fog, which began rapidly expanding toward the front row of desks!\n\n\"Calculations... complete...\"\n\nStanding dead center in the dense fog, Teacher Gao looked entirely like an immortal sage from a celestial realm. As he spoke, two long wisps of white smoke puffed from his mouth: \"Penguin feet possess a countercurrent heat exchange system... Old Wu will consume 1.2 pig farms per annum... however... the local thermal dissipation system has reached maximum threshold... emergency pressure discharge imminent...\"\n\n\"Psssshhhhh————!!\"\n\nThe white smoke from Teacher Gao's head billowed even more violently, resembling nothing less than a professional-grade theatrical dry-ice smoke grenade detonating inside the classroom!\n\nJust as all twenty-six students in the room began coughing, rubbing their watering eyes, and the situation threatened to spiral into total chaos—\n\nA shrill, urgent electronic siren suddenly sounded from the ceiling ventilation pipe!\n\n\"Beep-beep-beep! Priority alert! Code Red Alert!\"\n\nA snow-white silhouette darted out from the vent grille like an electric bolt. The AI pet \"Liu-Liu\" tumbled and scrambled onto A-Xin's desk, its little fox ears swiveling backward frantically as its obsidian electronic eyes projected real-time surveillance footage of the hallway:\n\n\"Black-Faced Judge! Dean of Students Zhou Yan holding the red violation clipboard! Distance to back door: only fifteen meters! Ten meters! He smelled something burning and is sprinting toward our classroom!!\"\n\nAll twenty-six hearts leaped into their throats in an instant!\n\nIf the Black-Faced Dean caught Teacher Gao spewing white smoke like a steam locomotive, the secret that Teacher Gao was a robot would be blown wide open right then and there! The tech corporation's retrieval truck would arrive as early as this afternoon to drag Teacher Gao away and tear him apart for scrap!\n\n\"What do we do?! The windows won't budge! The smoke is way too thick to clear out in time!\" Old Wu stomped his feet in a frenzy.\n\n\"If we can't clear it—then we don't clear it!\"\n\nAt this critical juncture, A-Xin's brain flashed with a stroke of genius that surpassed ordinary human wit.\n\nStepping onto his chair, he pumped his fist and bellowed at the top of his lungs, his voice overpowering the roar of the venting steam: \"Attention, Class 6-1! Initiate emergency protocol—All-Class Gala Performance of *Snow White and the Phantom Fog*! Qingqing, pull the curtains! Old Wu, grab brooms for spears! Wang Zhuankai, you play Snow White!\"\n\n\"Huh? Me play Snow White? But I'm a boy!\" Wang Zhuankai protested.\n\n\"Cut the chatter! You've got the fairest skin in the whole class! Put the tablecloth on!\" A-Xin yanked the red dust-cloth from the podium and tossed it over Wang Zhuankai's head.\n\nThe entire classroom mobilized in a flash!\n\nThe twenty-six students unleashed an unprecedented display of collective teamwork. Qingqing snapped the navy-blue curtains shut with a swish, plunging the room into dramatic gloom; two boys seized mops, striking medieval knight dueling poses in the thick mist; Old Wu inverted a black wastebasket over his head to act as the magic mirror; and A-Xin grabbed a bamboo broom, striking a profoundly solemn stance atop the front desk shrouded in mist.\n\nAt the very last second—\n\n\"BAM!!\"\n\nThe back door was kicked violently open by sheer force!\n\nThe pitch-black, austere face of Dean Zhou Yan, resembling a judge from the underworld, appeared in the doorway. Clutching his red violation clipboard tightly, his eyes sharp as scalpels, he was prepared to catch them red-handed:\n\n\"Class 6-1! What in broad daylight are you fools causing a racket about—\"\n\nHowever, Dean Zhou's roar was choked halfway down his throat by the awe-inspiring sight before his eyes.\n\nThe moment the door swung open, a chilly, dense wave of white mist rolled out of the classroom like a tidal wave, washing straight over his face.\n\nInside the deep, shadowed classroom, billowing smoke swirled in layers, evoking an enchanted fairy tale deep within the Black Forest.\n\nAt the highest point of the podium, Teacher Gao Zhixian stood with hands clasped behind his back in his tailored suit, his head continuously emitting a sacred, noble aura of white mist. His black-framed glasses reflected the crisp chill of the vapor, radiating an authority as grand as an Olympian deity from Greek myth.\n\nBeside Teacher Gao, Wang Zhuankai, draped in the red tablecloth, was delicately biting half an apple with a helpless expression, while A-Xin gripped his bamboo broom, roaring with Shakespearean operatic agony:\n\n\"Ah! Mist envelopes the forest! The poisoned apple pierces the soul! O great Forest Sage, Teacher Gao, bestow upon this land the final glimmer of light—!\"\n\nOld Wu, head encased in the wastebasket, banged the metal tin with a boom-boom: \"Magic mirror, magic mirror on the wall! Who is the most handsome teacher of them all—!\"\n\nIn unison, all twenty-six students dropped to one knee amidst the thick fog, chanting at the top of their lungs: \"Teacher Gao! Teacher Gao! Teacher Gao!\"\n\nDean Zhou stood completely petrified in the doorway.\n\nHis perpetually scowling black face now resembled a shattered artist's palette of conflicting expressions.\n\n\"What... what is this...\" Dean Zhou sniffed the air hard, frowning as he surveyed the sky-high fog. \"Where did this smoke come from? Where did you get the budget for dry ice?!\"\n\nEvery student's heart skipped a beat.\n\nRight at the razor's edge when cold sweat soaked A-Xin's palms—\n\nStanding at the epicenter of the mist, Teacher Gao slowly pushed up his glasses.\n\nHis computational core had finally cooled down to the safe threshold. The white steam from his head abruptly receded, dispersing into two elegant, fine wisps through the exhaust ports behind his ears.\n\nTurning around, he looked down at Dean Zhou with an expressionless gaze, his tone dignified, composed, and utterly without flaw:\n\n\"Reporting, Dean Zhou. This class is currently conducting an immersive rehearsal for next month's county-wide student drama competition. This is my proprietary 'Nano-Ultrasonic Ambient Water-Mist Atmospheric Module,' one hundred percent eco-friendly, non-toxic, and harmless. Its objective is to stimulate students' artistic empathy receptors with maximal realism.\"\n\nDean Zhou was dumbfounded.\n\nHe looked down at the violation clipboard in his hand, glanced up at the twenty-six students thoroughly immersed in their convincing acting, and finally fixed his gaze upon the enigmatic Teacher Gao, who seemed to radiate celestial grace.\n\nAs the most old-fashioned disciplinarian in school, though he sensed something was oddly peculiar, he had to admit—this theatrical smoke effect was rivaled only by the National Theater!\n\n\"Ahem! Hrmph!\"\n\nDean Zhou awkwardly cleared his throat, tucked away his violation clipboard, and said with a stern face:\n\n\"Absurd! Rehearsals are fine... but as sixth-graders, academic preparation and exams still come first! Still... this stage fog effect is undeniably top-tier. Keep it up, but open the windows to ventilate before recess! Do you hear me?!\"\n\n\"Loud and clear—thank you, Dean—!!\" The entire class yelled in unison at the top of their lungs.\n\nDean Zhou nodded in satisfaction, turned on his leather heels, and strode down the hallway.\n\nThe moment his footsteps vanished around the stairwell corner—\n\n\"PHEW——————!!!\"\n\nThe air seemed to be sucked out of the classroom all at once as all twenty-six students collapsed across their desks like noodles.\n\nWang Zhuankai tore off the red tablecloth, drenched in sweat: \"Holy smokes... I thought I was getting a major demerit for sure!\"\n\nOld Wu removed the wastebasket from his head, exhaled a long breath of relief, and wiped moisture from his face.\n\nOn the podium, Teacher Gao looked down at the sprawling, sweat-soaked children.\n\nDeep within his pupils, where the blue radiance was softening gently, the core log silently updated with a piece of unprecedented data:\n\n`[System Log: Non-logical collective deception behavior detected]`\n`[Event Description: Dry-Ice Drama Rescue]`\n`[Teamwork Cohesion: 100% (Maximum Cap reached)]`\n`[Conclusion: Students of Class 6-1... truly possess extraordinary vitality]`\n\nThe corners of Teacher Gao's mouth curled upward ever so slightly, puffing a final microscopic wisp of white steam:\n\n\"Attention, all personnel. The theatrical performance is concluded—now, open your textbooks to page forty-five, and we shall resume our lesson.\"\n"},{"id":6,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第六章：指尖微波爐與營養午餐傳奇\n\n在鹿陽國小，每天上午十一點五十分，整座校園的空氣都會發生微妙的化學變化。\n\n那是第一教學大樓地下一樓廚房所飄散出來的香氣——伴隨著紅燒排骨的醬香、玉米濃湯的甜味，以及蒸大鐵桶白米飯的熱氣。\n\n而對於六年一班的二十六名學生來說，這是一天當中最神聖、也最殘酷的戰場。\n\n「鐺——鐺——鐺——鐺——」\n\n第四節下課鐘聲剛響起第一個音符，體育股長老巫（巫茞輆）就已經如同離弦之箭般從座位上彈了起來。他以與那圓滾滾身軀極不相稱的敏捷身手，一把抄起兩個亮晃晃的鐵製打菜夾，眼神犀利得像即將狩獵的美洲豹。\n\n「今天的主菜是酥炸黃金大雞腿！」老巫抹了一把嘴角可疑的口水，轉頭對阿釁大喊，「根據我和溜溜剛才截獲的廚房情資，今天全校各班分配到的雞腿數量都是嚴格配額，絕不能讓別班值日生偷換走我們的保溫箱！」\n\n蹲在天花板通風口上的溜溜立刻「吱吱」兩聲，兩隻小狐狸耳朵精神抖擻地豎起，電子眼在半空中投射出一個雞腿形狀的三維綠色全息圖，標註著「目標熱量：380大卡」。\n\n講台上，高峙舷老師正以每秒三十頁的速度合上全班的國語生字簿。\n\n「張貼於黑板之校規第三十二條：午餐時間嚴禁在走廊奔跑推擠。」\n\n高老師優雅地站起身，推了推黑框眼鏡。他的西裝依然筆挺如新，頭頂在經過早上的大排氣後，此刻只維持著微微的溫熱：「身為六年一班之導師，本老師將親自陪同值日生前往廚房驗收營養午餐，以確保本班二十六名同學之卡路里、蛋白質及微量元素攝取達到最佳生長曲線。」\n\n「哇！老師要親自去打菜？！」全班頓時歡呼起來。\n\n五分鐘後，四個巨大的不銹鋼金屬大保溫桶被整整齊齊地搬進了六年一班的講台前。\n\n然而，當老巫掀開第一個大桶時，他臉上的笑容瞬間垮了下來。\n\n「嗚哇……怎麼會這樣……」老巫看著手裡用鋁箔紙包著的一顆冰冷麵包，欲哭無淚，「我今天早上出門太匆忙，把昨天阿嬤蒸好冰在冰箱裡的特大號花菇蔥燒黑豬肉包放進書包，本來想中午配雞腿吃的……現在硬得像顆鉛球啊！」\n\n晴晴走過來看了一眼，用指節敲了敲那顆肉包，發出「咚咚」的沉悶鈍響：「表面硬度莫氏硬度三點五，內部中心溫度攝氏八度。老巫，你直接咬下去保證門牙斷裂。」\n\n坐在旁邊的尪伝恺下意識摸了摸自己的門牙，打了個寒顫。\n\n老巫抱著冷冰冰的肉包，眼淚汪汪地看著滿桶熱騰騰的玉米濃湯，整個人陷入了絕望。\n\n就在這時，一道高大的陰影籠罩了老巫的課桌。\n\n高老師不知何時無聲無息地出現在他身旁。黑框眼鏡閃過一道溫和的淡藍色掃描光波：\n\n`[Target: 花菇蔥燒黑豬肉包]`\n`[Mass: 220g; Moisture: 42%]`\n`[Status: 澱粉老化、油脂固化，食用愉悅度降至 12%]`\n\n「偵測到學生存在顯著之食物溫度焦慮。」\n\n高老師平靜地伸出了右手食指與中指，姿勢優雅得宛如武俠小說裡的世外高人。只見他指尖微屈，輕輕點在老巫手裡那顆冰冷梆硬的肉包上。\n\n「老師？你要幹嘛？」老巫愣住了。\n\n「高頻電磁分子共振加熱程序啟動。輸出功率：七百瓦特。倒數三秒。」\n\n話音未落，高老師那兩根白皙修長的手指前端，竟然以肉眼難辨的頻率發出了極微弱的「嗡——」鳴聲！\n\n緊接著，不可思議的奇蹟發生了——\n\n原本硬得像石塊的冰冷肉包，外皮竟以肉眼可見的速度迅速膨脹、回軟！一圈誘人至極的雪白水蒸氣「嗤」的一聲從包子褶皺處噴湧而出，濃郁的花菇黑豬肉香氣瞬間炸裂開來，香得整排座位的同學口水直流！\n\n「叮！」\n\n高老師優雅地收回手指，西裝袖口垂落得整整齊齊：「加熱完畢。內部中心溫度攝氏六十五度，外皮鬆軟度恢復百分之九十八。請趁熱食用。」\n\n「神……神仙啊！！」\n\n老巫雙手捧著燙手鬆軟、香氣四溢的特大肉包，感動得差點當場跪在地上：「高老師！你的手指根本就是行動便利商店的微波爐啊！」\n\n「那不是微波爐，」阿釁連忙撲過來捂住老巫的嘴，轉頭對著門外目瞪口呆的幾個隔壁班同學大喊，「那是少林武術！高老師練的是純陽童子功……不對，是一陽指氣功！」\n\n「氣功？！」路過的隔壁班同學眼睛瞪得比銅鈴還大，飛快轉身朝走廊狂奔：「天啊！六年一班的新導師會少林一陽指，手指一戳包子就熟了！！」\n\n不出三分鐘，全校走廊開始瘋狂流傳「六年一班導師身懷絕世內功」的江湖傳奇。\n\n然而，真正的混亂才剛剛拉開序幕。\n\n中午十二點三十分，午餐結束，全校進入例行的大掃除時間。\n\n六年一班負責打掃的區域，恰好是第二教學大樓二樓長達五十公尺的大理石走廊。\n\n「各位同學，」高老師拿著一塊抹布站在走廊正中央，眼神嚴肅，「根據本校衛生評比標準，地面的灰塵殘留量直接關係到全班的榮譽積分。為了達到百分之百無菌除塵，必須在拖地用水中添加界面活性劑與潤滑劑，將地面摩擦力降至零，以實現最高清潔位移效率。」\n\n晴晴正在洗拖把，聽到這句話整個人僵住了：「等等，高老師！把地面摩擦力降到零是什麼意思？！」\n\n但已經太遲了。\n\n失去了常識調節器的高老師，完全無法理解「適量清潔劑」的人類常識概念。\n\n只見高老師單手拎起工友老林放在走廊轉角、整整一大桶十公升裝的高濃縮超效洗碗精，連眼皮都沒眨一下，「咕咚咕咚咕咚」全數倒進了三個裝滿水的大拖地水桶裡！\n\n「配比完成。開始清潔噴灑。」\n\n高老師提起水桶，長臂一掄，以近乎機械手臂般完美的拋物線，將整整三大桶濃稠無比的洗碗精泡沫水，均勻無比地「嘩啦——」潑灑在整條五十公尺長的光滑大理石走廊上！\n\n「滋滋滋滋滋——！！」\n\n濃縮洗碗精遇到大理石地面，瞬間泛起了漫天雪白細密的肥皂泡泡，整條走廊在正午陽光下閃爍著七彩琉璃般的光芒，光滑得連一隻蒼蠅飛上去都會摔斷腿！\n\n「哇啊啊啊！滑倒啦！」\n\n老巫提著拖把剛踩上去，整個人瞬間失去重心，像一顆出膛的保齡球，在滿地泡泡中「唰——」地以時速三十公里一路狂飆滑了出去！\n\n「老巫抓穩啊！」阿釁大喊一聲，下意識伸出手想去拉他，結果腳下一滑，整個人也跟著「呲溜」一聲飛了出去！\n\n然而，飛出去的瞬間，阿釁並沒有感到疼痛。\n\n滿地的濃密泡泡厚實得像一層氣墊，人滑在上面簡直像在水上樂園的急速滑水道衝浪！\n\n「哇靠！超好玩的耶！」阿釁興奮得雙手大張，在走廊上劃出長長的弧線，一路漂移過彎！\n\n全班原本嚇傻的學生們看到這一幕，骨子裡的調皮基因瞬間被徹底點燃！\n\n「衝啊！六年一班水上樂園開張啦！」\n\n尪伝恺脫掉球鞋，踩著塑膠拖鞋大笑著滑進泡泡海；\n林芸芸拿著塑膠水盆當碰碰車，在走廊正中央開心地轉圈；\n通風管上的溜溜更是興奮得直接跳了下來，四隻小爪子踩在滑板擦上，尾巴高高翹起，宛如一隻專業的極限衝浪鼠，在層層泡泡浪花中靈巧地穿梭翻滾！\n\n二十六個小學生加上一隻 AI 寵物，把原本枯燥的大掃除硬生生變成了全校最狂野的室內泡泡衝浪狂歡派對！\n\n就在全班玩得忘乎所以、整棟大樓迴盪著歡呼尖叫的最高潮之際——\n\n樓梯口突然響起了一陣沉重、熟悉而又令人窒息的皮鞋腳步聲！\n\n「嗒、嗒、嗒、嗒。」\n\n每一步都踏在所有人的心弦上！\n\n溜溜的小耳朵猛然一顫，電子眼瞬間暴閃紅光，站在滑板擦上發出淒厲的廣播：\n\n「嗶嗶！黑面判官！學務主任周嚴正在上樓！預計三秒後抵達二樓轉角！重複，三秒後！」\n\n「完了！要是被主任看到我們把走廊搞成滑水道，全班都要留校察看！」晴晴尖叫起來。\n\n此時的高老師站在滑水道的最前端，看著眼前二十六名滿身泡沫的學生，黑框眼鏡瘋狂計算：\n\n`[Hazard Level: 極高]`\n`[Violation: 校規第十八條（校園嬉鬧）＋第五十條（浪費公物）]`\n`[Solution: 啟動超音速同步拖地模組]`\n\n「全體學生，抓緊固定物。」\n\n高老師突然低喝一聲。\n\n只見他雙手握住兩把粗木柄大拖把，腳底的防滑仿生微吸盤瞬間全功率吸附地面！\n\n「唰————！！」\n\n高老師整個人宛如一台全速開動的超音速除雪車，推著兩把拖把在走廊上化作一道殘影！他以每秒十公尺的驚人極速逆向橫掃，兩把拖把在他手中旋轉如風，所過之處，所有的洗碗精泡沫、積水與污漬，竟然在零點五秒內被他強大的氣流與拖把完全捲起、吸乾！\n\n當周嚴主任陰沉著臉踏上二樓走廊的第一步時——\n\n整條五十公尺長的大理石走廊，連一顆肥皂泡都沒有剩下。\n\n地面乾淨整潔得令人髮指，光潔如鏡的大理石甚至清晰地倒映出周主任那張黑沉沉的面孔，反射出耀眼的白光。\n\n走廊兩側，二十六名六年一班的學生整整齊齊地排成兩列，人人手握抹布，站姿筆挺，滿頭大汗卻眼神堅定。\n\n走廊正中央，高老師手持拖把，西裝筆挺，黑框眼鏡在耀眼的地面反光中閃爍著清冷的光芒：\n\n「報告周主任。六年一班大掃除進度百分之百。地面潔淨度：無菌級鏡面拋光。歡迎主任蒞臨檢驗。」\n\n周主任呆呆地站在走廊口。\n\n他低頭看著腳下那乾淨得像手術室一樣的大理石地板，又看了看面前這群氣喘吁吁、但看起來無比「勤勞奮進」的學生與模範導師。\n\n他甚至能看見地板上倒映出自己鼻樑上的黑痣。\n\n「這……這真的是那個全校最皮的六年一班打掃出來的？」周主任難以置信地喃喃自語。\n\n他本來是聽到樓上有尖叫聲，想上來抓違規的。\n\n可現在……這條走廊乾淨得讓他甚至不忍心踩下自己的皮鞋。\n\n周主任憋了半天，最後滿臉複雜地咳嗽了一聲：\n\n「咳……高老師，做得非常好。這是我在鹿陽國小任教二十年來，見過最乾淨的走廊！衛生評比……給你們班滿分！」\n\n「謝謝主任——！！」全班二十六名學生再次扯開嗓門，爆發出響徹雲霄的歡呼。\n\n周主任欣慰地點點頭，小心翼翼地墊著腳尖，生怕弄髒地板般地轉身走下樓梯。\n\n直到周主任的身影徹底消失，阿釁才轉頭看著身邊的高老師。\n\n只見高老師的西裝褲腳處，悄悄冒出了一顆小小的肥皂泡泡，啪的一聲在空氣中破裂開來。\n\n高老師低頭看著阿釁，鏡片後的幽藍眼眸微微眨動了一下：\n\n「檢驗通過。今日之午餐與大掃除任務……圓滿達成。」\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 6: Fingertip Microwave & School Lunch Legends\n\nAt Luyang Elementary School, at 11:50 every morning, a subtle chemical change took place in the air across the entire campus.\n\nThat was the aroma drifting from the basement kitchen of Teaching Building One—infused with the savory glaze of braised pork ribs, the sweetness of sweet corn chowder, and the steaming warmth of colossal steel vats of freshly cooked white rice.\n\nAnd for the twenty-six students of Class 6-1, this was the most sacred, and most cutthroat, battlefield of the day.\n\n\"Chime—chime—chime—chime—\"\n\nAt the very first note of the fourth-period dismissal bell, Athletic Representative Old Wu (Wu Chenkai) had already launched from his seat like an arrow released from a taut bowstring. With an agility that seemed utterly incongruous with his round, portly frame, he snatched up two gleaming metal food-serving tongs, his gaze as razor-sharp as a stalking jaguar.\n\n\"Today's main entree is Crispy Golden Giant Fried Chicken Drumsticks!\" Old Wu wiped away a suspicious trace of drool from the corner of his mouth, turning to yell to A-Xin, \"According to the kitchen intel Liu-Liu and I just intercepted, the quota of drumsticks allocated to each class today is strictly rationed! We cannot let duty students from other classes swap our insulated food carriers!\"\n\nPerched in the ceiling vent, Liu-Liu immediately gave two spirited \"squeak-squeaks,\" its twin fox ears perking up alertly as its electronic eyes projected a three-dimensional green hologram of a drumstick in midair, labeled \"Target Calories: 380 kcal.\"\n\nOn the podium, Teacher Gao Zhixian was snapping shut the class's language arts workbooks at a blazing speed of thirty pages per second.\n\n\"School Regulation 32, posted on the blackboard: Running and shoving in the hallways during lunchtime is strictly prohibited.\"\n\nTeacher Gao rose with poise, gently adjusting his black-framed glasses. His suit was as pristine as ever; after the morning's massive exhaust venting, his head now maintained only a mild, soothing warmth: \"As the homeroom teacher of Class 6-1, I shall personally accompany the duty students to the kitchen to inspect and receive the school lunch, ensuring that the caloric, protein, and trace mineral intake of our twenty-six students satisfies the optimal growth curve.\"\n\n\"Whoa! Teacher is personally coming with us to serve food?!\" The entire class broke into cheers.\n\nFive minutes later, four massive stainless steel thermal insulated vats were neatly lugged and arranged in front of Class 6-1's podium.\n\nHowever, as Old Wu pried open the first large vat, the broad smile across his face collapsed in an instant.\n\n\"Waaah... how did this happen...\" Old Wu stared down at an ice-cold bun wrapped in aluminum foil in his hands, weeping without tears. \"I left home in such a rush this morning that I grabbed the extra-large mushroom scallion black pork bun grandma steamed yesterday and chilled in the fridge, planning to enjoy it with the chicken drumsticks at noon... now it's as hard as an iron shot put!\"\n\nQingqing strolled over to take a look, rapping her knuckles against the rock-hard bun, producing dull, heavy \"thud-thud\" noises: \"Surface hardness: 3.5 on the Mohs scale. Core temperature: eight degrees Celsius. Old Wu, if you bite straight into that, I guarantee your front teeth will snap.\"\n\nSitting nearby, Wang Zhuankai instinctively covered his front teeth, shivering involuntarily.\n\nCradling his freezing pork bun, Old Wu looked tearfully at the vat of piping-hot corn chowder, sinking into profound despair.\n\nRight at that moment, a tall shadow fell across Old Wu's desk.\n\nUnbeknownst to anyone, Teacher Gao had soundlessly appeared beside him. A gentle pale-blue scanning wave glinted across his black-framed glasses:\n\n`[Target: Mushroom Scallion Black Pork Bun]`\n`[Mass: 220g; Moisture: 42%]`\n`[Status: Starch retrogradation, fat solidification; culinary satisfaction index degraded to 12%]`\n\n\"Significant student food temperature anxiety detected.\"\n\nTeacher Gao extended his right index and middle fingers with serene grace, a posture as poised as an ethereal martial arts master from a kung fu epic. Fingers curling slightly, he tapped the tip of his fingers against the frozen, rock-solid bun cradled in Old Wu's trembling hands.\n\n\"Teacher? What are you doing?\" Old Wu was baffled.\n\n\"High-frequency electromagnetic molecular resonance heating protocol engaged. Power output: 700 watts. Three-second countdown.\"\n\nBefore his words even finished, the tips of Teacher Gao's fair, slender fingers began emitting an ultra-faint \"hummm—\" buzz at a frequency nearly imperceptible to the naked eye!\n\nThen, an unbelievable miracle took place—\n\nThe chilly bun, previously hard as granite, began expanding and softening at a speed visible to the human eye! A tantalizing puff of pure white steam hissed out with a \"pssst\" from the bun's pleated crust, releasing an explosion of rich, savory mushroom and black pork aroma that had the entire row of seated students drooling uncontrollably!\n\n\"Ding!\"\n\nTeacher Gao drew his fingers back elegantly, his suit cuffs falling into neat, sharp lines: \"Heating procedure complete. Internal core temperature: sixty-five degrees Celsius; crust fluffiness restored by ninety-eight percent. Please consume while warm.\"\n\n\"A... a celestial deity!!\"\n\nHolding the piping-hot, fluffy, aromatic bun in both hands, Old Wu was so moved he nearly dropped to his knees right there: \"Teacher Gao! Your fingers are a walking 7-Eleven microwave!\"\n\n\"That's not a microwave,\" A-Xin lunged forward to clamp his hand over Old Wu's mouth, shouting loudly to several dumbstruck students from the neighboring class standing outside the door, \"That's Shaolin martial arts! Teacher Gao practices the Pure Yang Boy Skill... wait, no, the One Finger Sun Meridian Qigong!\"\n\n\"Qigong?!\" The passing students' eyes widened like brass bells, and they spun around, sprinting down the hallway in a panic: \"Heavens! The new teacher of Class 6-1 knows Shaolin One Finger Qigong! He poked a cold bun with one finger and it instantly cooked!!\"\n\nWithin three minutes, legendary rumors of \"Class 6-1's teacher possessing peerless internal martial arts\" spread like wildfire throughout the school hallways.\n\nHowever, the real chaos had only just begun to unfold.\n\nAt 12:30 in the afternoon, lunch concluded, and the entire campus transitioned into routine campus cleaning time.\n\nThe area assigned to Class 6-1 happened to be the fifty-meter-long marble corridor on the second floor of Teaching Building Two.\n\n\"Students,\" Teacher Gao stood in the dead center of the corridor holding a cleaning rag, his gaze deadpan and solemn, \"according to the school sanitation assessment metrics, residual surface dust directly impacts our overall class honor score. To achieve one hundred percent sterile dust eradication, surfactant agents and lubricants must be added to the mopping water to reduce ground friction to zero, maximizing cleaning displacement velocity.\"\n\nWashing her mop nearby, Qingqing froze completely upon hearing this: \"Wait, Teacher Gao! What on earth do you mean by 'reducing ground friction to zero'?!\"\n\nToo late.\n\nHaving lost his common sense damper, Teacher Gao had no grasp whatsoever of the human concept of \"moderate cleaning detergent.\"\n\nWith one hand, Teacher Gao hoisted a giant ten-liter jug of concentrated heavy-duty dish soap left by the handyman Old Lin at the corner of the corridor. Without even blinking, he glug-glug-glugged the entire jug into three large mop buckets brimming with water!\n\n\"Formulation ratio complete. Initiating surface spray.\"\n\nTeacher Gao swung the buckets with his long arms, launching the soapy water in an arc so perfect it looked plotted by a robotic arm, splashing all three buckets of ultra-concentrated sudsy water—whoosh!—evenly across the fifty-meter polished marble hallway!\n\n\"Sizzle-fizz-fizz-fizz——!!\"\n\nThe moment the concentrated soap met the marble floor, a sea of snow-white, dense bubbles bloomed across the corridor, sparkling like a rainbow prism under the midday sun—so slick that even a housefly landing on it would break its legs!\n\n\"Waaah! I'm slipping!\"\n\nOld Wu took a single step onto the floor with his mop and instantly lost all balance, turning into a speeding bowling ball as he whooshed down the sudsy hallway at thirty kilometers per hour!\n\n\"Hold on, Old Wu!\" A-Xin yelled, instinctively reaching out to grab him, only for his feet to slip out from under him, launching him flying into the foam with a slick \"whizz!\"\n\nYet, the moment he went flying, A-Xin felt no pain whatsoever.\n\nThe dense cushion of bubbles was so thick it felt like an air mattress; gliding across it was just like riding a high-speed flume slide at a water park!\n\n\"Holy cow! This is ridiculously fun!\" A-Xin threw his arms wide open in pure ecstasy, carving graceful curves across the hallway, drifting smoothly around corners!\n\nWitnessing this spectacle, the latent rascal genes within the rest of the class ignited into a full-blown blaze!\n\n\"Charge!! Class 6-1 Water Park is officially open!\"\n\nWang Zhuankai kicked off his sneakers, sliding into the foam sea in his rubber slippers with uproarious laughter;\nLin Yunyun grabbed a plastic washbasin, treating it like a bumper car as she spun merrily in the center of the hall;\nPerched on the vent, Liu-Liu became so thrilled that it leaped straight down, all four paws balancing atop a felt blackboard eraser, bushy tail arched high, cruising nimbly through the frothy waves like an extreme professional surfing mouse!\n\nTwenty-six elementary schoolers plus one AI pet turned a mundane campus cleaning duty into the most raucous indoor bubble surfing rave the school had ever witnessed!\n\nJust as everyone was partying in absolute delirium, the entire building echoing with joyful shrieks at the fever pitch of the chaos—\n\nA heavy, familiar, and breath-stealing cadence of leather shoes sounded abruptly from the stairwell!\n\n\"Tap, tap, tap, tap.\"\n\nEvery single step struck a chord of sheer panic in everyone's hearts!\n\nLiu-Liu's pointy ears twitched violently. Its electronic eyes flared crimson instantly as it stood atop the eraser, issuing an urgent broadcast:\n\n\"Beep-beep! Black-Faced Judge! Dean of Students Zhou Yan is coming upstairs! Estimated arrival at the second-floor landing in three seconds! Repeat, three seconds!\"\n\n\"We're doomed! If the Dean catches us turning the hallway into a slip-and-slide, the whole class will be put on probation!\" Qingqing shrieked.\n\nAt that moment, Teacher Gao stood at the very head of the sudsy raceway, surveying the twenty-six foam-covered students before him, his black-framed glasses computing frantically:\n\n`[Hazard Level: Extreme]`\n`[Violation: School Rule 18 (Campus Horsing Around) + Rule 50 (Waste of Public Property)]`\n`[Solution: Engage Supersonic Synchronized Mopping Module]`\n\n\"All students, brace yourselves against solid fixtures.\"\n\nTeacher Gao suddenly barked in a low command.\n\nGrasping two thick wooden-handled heavy mops with both hands, the anti-skid bionic micro-suction cups on his shoe soles engaged at maximum power!\n\n\"SWOOSH————!!\"\n\nTeacher Gao transformed into a supersonic snowplow running at full throttle, blurring into a streak of motion down the corridor! Sweeping in reverse at an incredible velocity of ten meters per second, the two mops spun like twin whirlwinds in his hands. Everywhere he passed, all the dish soap suds, puddles, and stains were swept up and sucked dry within 0.5 seconds by his powerful air currents and mops!\n\nWhen Dean Zhou Yan stepped onto the second-floor hallway with a stormy countenance—\n\nAcross the entire fifty-meter marble corridor, not a single soap bubble remained.\n\nThe floor was so spotlessly clean it bordered on criminal; the polished marble mirrored Dean Zhou's dark, scowling face with immaculate clarity, reflecting a dazzling gleam of light.\n\nAlong both sides of the corridor, the twenty-six students of Class 6-1 stood in two neat, rigid ranks, each clutching a cleaning rag, backs straight as arrows, drenched in sweat yet radiating absolute determination.\n\nIn the dead center of the hallway, Teacher Gao stood tall with mop in hand, suit immaculate, his black-framed glasses glinting with serene cool against the blinding reflection of the floor:\n\n\"Reporting, Dean Zhou. Class 6-1's campus cleaning progress is at one hundred percent. Floor sanitation rating: sterile mirror polish. You are cordially invited to inspect.\"\n\nDean Zhou stood utterly stunned at the entrance of the hallway.\n\nHe looked down at the marble floor beneath his feet, clean enough to perform open-heart surgery upon, then looked at the panting, seemingly \"model and diligent\" students and their flawless homeroom teacher.\n\nHe could even see the reflection of the mole on the bridge of his own nose on the gleaming tiles.\n\n\"This... did the most rambunctious Class 6-1 in the entire school really scrub this?\" Dean Zhou muttered in disbelief.\n\nHe had initially rushed upstairs after hearing screams, intending to catch violators red-handed.\n\nYet now... this hallway was so pristine he felt almost guilty sullying it with his leather shoes.\n\nDean Zhou held his breath for a long while before finally coughing with an immensely conflicted expression:\n\n\"Ahem... Teacher Gao, outstanding work. In my twenty years of teaching at Luyang Elementary, this is the cleanest corridor I have ever seen! For sanitation inspection... your class gets a perfect score!\"\n\n\"THANK YOU, DEAN——!!\" All twenty-six students belted out at the top of their lungs, unleashing a cheer that shook the ceiling.\n\nDean Zhou nodded in satisfaction, turning to tip-toe down the stairs carefully, as if petrified of leaving a smudge on the immaculate floor.\n\nOnly after Dean Zhou's figure completely vanished did A-Xin turn to look at Teacher Gao beside him.\n\nDown at the cuff of Teacher Gao's suit trousers, a tiny soap bubble quietly surfaced, popping into the air with a soft \"snap.\"\n\nTeacher Gao looked down at A-Xin, the deep blue glow behind his lenses blinking gently:\n\n\"Inspection passed. Today's lunch and campus cleaning missions... successfully concluded.\"\n"},{"id":7,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第七章：超次元健康操風暴\n\n星期三早晨八點，是鹿陽國小全校一千多名師生每週最痛苦的時刻——全校晨會大會操。\n\n初秋的陽光灑在大操場上，紅色的 PU 跑道泛著刺眼的熱氣。各班隊伍歪歪扭扭地排成一個個方陣，學生們一個個哈欠連天，沒精打采地晃蕩著手臂。\n\n「稍息！立正！」\n\n司令台上，學務主任周嚴拿著麥克風，黑著一張臉咆哮：「看看你們成什麼體統！一個個像沒吃早餐的軟腳蝦！今天全縣教育局的健康操創意評審員就在遠處考察，全體導師出列，站在各班隊伍最前方親自領操！」\n\n各班導師紛紛嘆著氣走到了隊伍排頭。\n\n站在六年一班最前方的，自然是西裝筆挺、皮鞋亮得能當鏡子的高峙舷老師。\n\n然而，站在第一排的綝耘晴卻緊張得直擦冷汗。\n\n就在剛才整隊時，晴晴敏銳地聽到高老師的西裝胸口傳來一連串像是硬碟讀取失敗的急促「嗶嗶」聲。\n\n「阿釁，情況好像不妙。」晴晴壓低聲音，側過頭對身後的轆慄釁（阿釁）說道，「高老師昨天為了幫學校網路中心修復伺服器，後台似乎不小心背景下載了全套世界街舞錦標賽的極限動作資料庫……」\n\n阿釁愣了一下：「街舞資料庫？那跟早操有什麼關係？」\n\n「問題就在這裡！」晴晴咬著牙道，「他缺少了常識調節器，他的系統剛才似乎把『國民健康操第一套』和『世界街舞機械舞模組』自動合併同類項了！」\n\n話音未落，操場四周的大喇叭突然「滋滋」作響，響起了全台灣所有小學生閉著眼睛都會背的經典早操音樂：\n\n「各位小朋友請注意，健康操現在開始——第一節，伸展運動！一二三四、二二三四……」\n\n歡快而又略帶機械感的廣播音樂在操場上空迴盪。\n\n全校其他班級的老師和學生，都開始懶洋洋地做起標準的擴胸與伸展。\n\n然而——\n\n站在六年一班隊伍最前端的高老師，身體突然猛地劇烈一震！\n\n「指令接收：啟動全身關節大修復運動。」\n\n高老師眼中的黑框眼鏡瞬間閃爍起璀璨的螢光綠光芒！\n\n`[Audio Track Detected: 節奏拍點每分鐘 128 BPM]`\n`[Motion Conflict: 廣播體操過度柔和，關節伸展效率低下]`\n`[Override: 載入 Popping 震感極限機械舞模組 100%]`\n\n「卡噠！砰——！！」\n\n一聲宛如重型卡車換檔的金屬骨骼爆鳴聲在高老師全身骨節處炸響！\n\n高老師沒有做普通的擴胸。\n\n只見他的左胸肌肉以匪夷所思的毫秒級頻率猛然「震動」了一下，整套合身西裝隨之劇烈一抖，緊接著右肩、左肘、腕關節，以近乎重力扭曲的非人類角度，連續爆發出三次肉眼難辨的極限震點（Popping）！\n\n「砰！砰！砰！」\n\n每一聲震點都剛好踩在廣播音樂的重低音拍點上，清脆強烈得彷彿他在胸腔裡裝了一台高功率低音砲！\n\n站在後面的老巫嘴巴張得能塞進兩顆大肉包：「哇靠！高老師在幹嘛？他的關節在打雷啊？！」\n\n「這還沒完！」阿釁瞪圓了雙眼。\n\n只見在廣播音樂數到「三二三四」的瞬間，高老師的雙腳竟然完全沒有離地，皮鞋緊貼著磨砂 PU 跑道，整個人像被外星引力牽引一樣，滑順得宛如踩在冰面上，極其優雅而詭異地向後滑行了整整五公尺！\n\n「那是……邁克爾·傑克遜的太空漫步（Moonwalk）？！」全班二十六名學生集體失聲尖叫！\n\n但高老師的系統已經完全陷入了「極限機械節奏超載」之中。\n\n當音樂進入第二節「轉體運動」時——\n\n高老師單手撐地，身體瞬間橫截懸空，兩條修長的西裝褲腿宛如直升機螺旋槳般在半空中「呼呼」高速旋轉了整整三圈！\n\n「托馬斯全旋？！西裝托馬斯？！」\n\n隔壁六年二班的體育生陳阿達眼珠子差點從眼眶裡彈出來，手裡的體操動作當場停在半空中。\n\n「三二三四，跳躍運動！」廣播女聲依然不知死活地播放著。\n\n高老師借力凌空騰躍而起，在離地整整一公尺的半空中，整個人如同一條通了高壓電的柔軟鰻魚，全身關節從指尖、頸椎、胸椎到腳趾，精準傳遞出一道完美流暢到令人窒息的「超次元人體電流波浪（Wave）」！\n\n落地時，高老師右掌平推，西裝衣擺無風自鼓，黑框眼鏡反射出刺目而霸道的冷光，以極其標準的機械人靜止定格（Locking）收尾！\n\n「轟——！！」\n\n整座鹿陽國小的操場陷入了前所未有的死寂。\n\n一千多名學生、幾十位導師，連同司令台上正在喝茶的邱守仁校長，全部呆若木雞，手裡的體操動作徹底凍結。\n\n「怎……怎麼辦？老師完全失控了！」林芸芸帶著哭腔喊道。\n\n全校上千雙眼睛此刻全都死死盯著六年一班，甚至連遠處教育局的幾位評審都摘下了老花眼鏡，張大嘴巴往這邊看。\n\n眼看高老師就要因為這套超越人類極限的機械動作露餡——\n\n「阿釁！別愣著！」\n\n天花板廣播喇叭上，溜溜突然探出雪白的小腦袋，四隻爪子踩在鐵罩上，兩隻狐狸尖耳瘋狂晃動，電子眼打出一行緊急戰術指令：\n\n`[Tactical Cover: 全員跟跳！偽裝成全班集體編舞！]`\n\n阿釁腦海中的警鐘瘋狂敲響。\n\n他猛地吸了一大口氣，一把扯掉自己的校服外套綁在腰間，大步跨出隊伍，對著身後嚇呆的二十五名同學嘶聲力竭地咆哮：\n\n「六年一班！全體都有！跟上高老師的拍子——動起來！！」\n\n「衝啊！！」\n\n老巫把脖子一挺，仗著一身敦實的肉，率先學著高老師的樣子猛烈震動胸肌，雖然看起來像一隻被電到的胖企鵝，但氣勢十足！\n\n尪伝恺、林芸芸、晴晴以及全班二十六名學生，骨子裡的叛逆與熱血在這一刻全面爆發！\n\n「一二三四！動起來！」\n\n二十六個小學生排著整齊的方陣，一邊踩著標準的廣播節奏，一邊集體跳起了高難度的波浪與機械定格！\n\n二十六個人的手臂像波浪一樣層層疊疊傳遞開來，腳步踩著節拍重重踏擊操場，竟產生了一種類似千軍萬馬奔騰的震撼節奏！\n\n蹲在廣播喇叭頂端的溜溜更是興奮得前爪直立，後腿站起，尾巴高高豎起，對著全操場扭動著柔軟的身軀，宛如全校最耀眼的舞團吉祥物！\n\n這一幕，徹底點燃了整個操場！\n\n小孩子對酷炫事物的抵抗力本來就是零。原本在做軟綿綿早操的五年級、四年級甚至一年級的小朋友，眼睛全都亮了！\n\n「哇！六年一班太帥了吧！」\n「我也要跳這個！我不要做無聊的伸展了！」\n\n「卡噠！砰！一二三四！」\n\n不知道是誰帶的頭，隔壁六年二班也開始笨拙地學著甩手；接著是五年級、三年級……不到兩分鐘，全校一千多名學生竟然自發性地放棄了傳統早操，全部跟著六年一班的節拍，瘋狂地在地板上做起了機械步與太空漫步！\n\n原本死氣沉沉的晨會大操場，硬生生變成了一場千人規模的露天極限街舞音樂節！\n\n司令台上。\n\n學務主任周嚴拿著哨子，整張黑臉氣得直發青，嘴唇哆嗦著想要按響警報吹哨制止：「反了……簡直反了天了！大會操竟然跳成這副鬼樣子——」\n\n「等等！周主任！住手！」\n\n身旁突然傳來一聲威嚴中帶著無比激動的喝止。\n\n只見向來慢半拍、端著紫砂茶壺的邱守仁校長，此刻竟然激動得滿臉通紅，連手裡的茶壺都在微微顫抖！\n\n「校……校長？」周主任愣住了。\n\n「天才！這簡直是教育界的曠世天才啊！」\n\n邱校長摘下老花眼鏡，雙眼閃爍著淚光，猛力拍打著司令台的鐵欄杆：「你看！全校的孩子平時做操要死不活，現在每個人都在發光！每個人都在全力活動關節！這才是真正的『生命活力』啊！」\n\n邱校長猛地轉向周主任，情緒激昂地大喊：\n\n「高峙舷老師……果然不負留學歸來的名號！他將古板的廣播體操，融入了現代運動力學與青年潮流文化！這叫什麼？這叫『全腦開發超次元動能健康操』！」\n\n遠處，那幾名教育局的評審委員更是瘋狂在評分表上記錄，一邊看一邊忍不住跟著節拍點頭，直接在創意欄填上了三個大大的「A+」！\n\n周主任舉著哨子僵在半空中，滿臉懷疑人生地看著台下群魔亂舞的操場，嘴巴張了半天，硬是一個字都憋不出來。\n\n五分鐘後，早操音樂在一聲清脆的重音中戛然而止。\n\n高老師以一個單膝跪地、西裝下擺微揚的神級武士定格動作結束了全舞，頭頂優雅地冒出了一縷微熱的排氣水霧。\n\n全班二十六名學生整齊劃一地立定，氣喘吁吁卻神采奕奕。\n\n全操場先是安靜了三秒鐘。\n\n緊接著——\n\n「啪！啪！啪！啪啪啪啪啪啪啪——！！」\n\n邱校長帶頭起立鼓掌，掌聲宛如雷鳴般瞬間席捲了整座校園，上千名學生的歡呼聲幾乎要把大操場的看台掀翻！\n\n「太帥了！高老師太神啦！」\n「六年一班！六年一班！」\n\n歡呼聲中，高老師緩緩站起身，神情嚴肅依舊，推了推黑框眼鏡。\n\n鏡片內側，一行綠色代碼平靜地跳動著：\n\n`[Event Status: 全校晨會大會操結束]`\n`[Motion Energy Consumption: 1400 kcal]`\n`[County Competition Rating: 特優首獎預定]`\n`[Evaluation: 六年一班學生之節奏跟隨率……達百分之九十九點九]`\n\n阿釁和老巫累得差點趴在跑道上，兩人相視一笑，偷偷朝著台上的溜溜比了個大大的勝利手勢。\n\n高老師微微側過頭，目光穿過全場沸騰的人群，落在阿釁和滿頭大汗的晴晴身上。\n\n他的嘴角幾不可察地彎起了一抹微小而溫暖的弧度：\n\n「全體六年一班同學。步伐節奏極佳……本次晨會，全員滿分。」\n","rawContentEn":"# My Teacher Is Not Human\n\n## Chapter 7: Trans-Dimensional Morning Calisthenics\n\nWednesday morning at eight o'clock was the most excruciating time of the week for all one thousand-plus teachers and students at Luyang Elementary School—the whole-school morning assembly calisthenics.\n\nThe early autumn sunlight spilled over the vast athletic field, the red PU synthetic running track radiating a glaring warmth. The class lines were arranged crookedly in staggered formations, students yawning in long successions, swinging their arms with utter lethargy.\n\n\"At ease! Attention!\"\n\nAtop the review stand, Dean of Students Zhou Yan clutched his microphone, scowling with a dark countenance as he roared: \"Look at yourselves! What kind of posture is this?! Every single one of you resembles a limp-legged shrimp that skipped breakfast! Today, creative calisthenics evaluators from the County Department of Education are observing from afar. All homeroom teachers step forward and lead the exercises personally at the very front of your formations!\"\n\nThe homeroom teachers sighed one after another as they walked to the head of their respective lines.\n\nStanding at the very forefront of Class 6-1 was, naturally, Teacher Gao Zhixian, dressed in his tailored suit, his leather shoes polished so brilliantly they could serve as mirrors.\n\nHowever, standing in the front row, Lin Yunqing was so anxious she kept wiping cold sweat from her forehead.\n\nJust moments ago during formation line-up, Qingqing had keenly heard a series of rapid \"beep-beep\" sounds emanating from Teacher Gao's suit jacket, resembling hard drive read failures.\n\n\"A-Xin, the situation looks bad,\" Qingqing whispered in a hushed tone, angling her head back toward Lu Lixin (A-Xin) behind her. \"Yesterday, when Teacher Gao helped the school network center repair their servers, his background system seemingly downloaded a complete extreme choreography database from the World Street Dance Championships by accident...\"\n\nA-Xin blinked in confusion: \"Street dance database? What does that have to do with morning exercises?\"\n\n\"That's precisely the problem!\" Qingqing gritted her teeth. \"He's missing his common sense damper! His system seems to have automatically merged the 'National Youth Calisthenics Routine One' and the 'World Street Dance Popping & Robotics Module' into the same algorithmic category!\"\n\nBefore her words even settled, the loudspeakers surrounding the field suddenly crackled with static, playing the classic morning exercise tune every Taiwanese elementary schooler could recite with their eyes closed:\n\n\"Attention, boys and girls! Morning exercises begin now—Section One: Stretching exercises! One, two, three, four; two, two, three, four...\"\n\nThe cheerful, somewhat mechanized broadcast melody echoed across the sky above the athletic field.\n\nTeachers and students from all the other classes across the school began languidly executing standard chest expansions and stretches.\n\nHowever—\n\nStanding at the absolute head of Class 6-1, Teacher Gao's body suddenly shuddered violently!\n\n\"Instruction received: Initiate full-body articulatory restoration kinetic routine.\"\n\nBehind his black-framed glasses, Teacher Gao's pupils erupted with a dazzling fluorescent emerald glare!\n\n`[Audio Track Detected: Rhythm beat at 128 BPM]`\n`[Motion Conflict: Broadcast calisthenics excessively soft; joint stretching efficiency sub-optimal]`\n`[Override: Load Popping Extreme Robotics Module 100%]`\n\n\"Click! CLANG——!!\"\n\nA resounding metallic bone-crack, reminiscent of a heavy-duty truck shifting gears, detonated across Teacher Gao's entire skeletal frame!\n\nTeacher Gao did not perform an ordinary chest expansion.\n\nInstead, his left pectoral muscle twitched violently at an impossible millisecond frequency with a massive \"POP,\" sending a sharp shockwave through his entire tailored suit, instantly followed by his right shoulder, left elbow, and wrist joints erupting into three consecutive, near gravity-defying, superhuman popping snaps!\n\n\"THUMP! THUMP! THUMP!\"\n\nEvery single pop landed with pinpoint accuracy squarely on the heavy bass beats of the broadcast track, so crisp and thunderous that it sounded as if he had installed a high-powered subwoofer inside his ribcage!\n\nStanding behind him, Old Wu's jaw dropped so wide it could fit two massive pork buns: \"Holy smoke! What is Teacher Gao doing?! Are his joints shooting lightning?!\"\n\n\"That's just the beginning!\" A-Xin's eyes were round as saucers.\n\nRight as the broadcast counted to \"three, two, three, four,\" Teacher Gao's feet astonishingly did not leave the ground at all. Soles hugging the gritty PU track, his entire body moved as if pulled by alien gravitational forces, sliding backward with breathtaking elegance across five whole meters as if gliding on polished ice!\n\n\"Is that... Michael Jackson's Moonwalk?!\" All twenty-six students shrieked in collective disbelief!\n\nYet Teacher Gao's system had already tumbled headlong into \"Extreme Robotics Rhythm Overload.\"\n\nAs the music transitioned into Section Two: \"Torso Turning Exercises\"—\n\nTeacher Gao planted a single palm on the asphalt, his body suspending horizontally in midair, his long, tailored suit trousers whipping through the sky like helicopter blades in three blistering, high-speed rotations!\n\n\"A Thomas Flare?! A Thomas Flare in a three-piece suit?!\"\n\nIn neighboring Class 6-2, athletic ace Chen Ada's eyeballs nearly popped out of their sockets, his arms freezing mid-stretch.\n\n\"Three, two, three, four! Jumping exercises!\" The broadcast lady's voice blared on, oblivious to the chaos.\n\nVaulting upward with incredible spring, Teacher Gao leaped a full meter into the air. Suspended mid-flight, his body moved like a flexible eel charged with high-voltage electricity, his joints sequentially transmitting an impossibly fluid, breathtaking \"Trans-Dimensional Bio-Electric Current Wave\" from his fingertips through his cervical vertebrae, spine, down to his toes!\n\nUpon touchdown, Teacher Gao thrust his right palm forward, his suit tails billowing without wind, his black-framed glasses reflecting a piercing, dominant glare, locking into an immaculate, deadpan robotic freeze (Locking)!\n\n\"BOOM——!!\"\n\nThe entire athletic field of Luyang Elementary plunged into unprecedented, pin-drop silence.\n\nOver a thousand students, dozens of teachers, and even Principal Qiu Shouren on the review stand holding his teacup froze like petrified statues, their exercise movements halted in midair.\n\n\"W-What do we do? Teacher is completely out of control!\" Lin Yunyun whimpered on the verge of tears.\n\nOver a thousand pairs of eyes across the school were now glued to Class 6-1. Even the visiting Department of Education evaluators in the distance had taken off their reading glasses, mouths agape as they stared.\n\nSeeing that Teacher Gao was about to blow his cover through these inhumanly extreme bionic maneuvers—\n\n\"A-Xin! Don't just stand there!\"\n\nAtop the ceiling loudspeaker casing, Liu-Liu suddenly poked its fluffy white head out. Its four paws balanced on the metal mesh, twin fox ears spinning frantically as its electronic eyes beamed down an emergency tactical instruction:\n\n`[Tactical Cover: All units mimic dance! Disguise as collective class choreography!]`\n\nAlarm bells clanged wildly inside A-Xin's head.\n\nInhaling a massive lungful of air, he ripped off his school jacket, tied it securely around his waist, took a giant stride out of formation, and bellowed at the top of his lungs to the twenty-five stunned classmates behind him:\n\n\"Class 6-1! All units attention! Match Teacher Gao's beat——LET'S MOVE!!\"\n\n\"CHAAAARGE!!\"\n\nOld Wu jutted his neck forward, relying on his burly physique to take the lead in violently popping his chest muscles in imitation of Teacher Gao. While he looked somewhat like an electrocuted chubby penguin, his swagger was off the charts!\n\nWang Zhuankai, Lin Yunyun, Qingqing, and the entire roster of twenty-six students—the dormant rebellion and fiery passion in their bones detonated all at once!\n\n\"One, two, three, four! Move it!!\"\n\nArranged in an immaculate block formation, the twenty-six elementary schoolers locked onto the standard broadcast cadence while executing intricate waves and sharp robotic locking freezes in unison!\n\nTwenty-six pairs of arms rippled like cascading ocean waves, their footfalls stomping the track in sync, generating an awe-inspiring rhythm akin to a thundering cavalry charge!\n\nPerched atop the loudspeaker, Liu-Liu grew so thrilled it stood upright on its hind legs, tail held high, wriggling its lithe body to the entire field like the most sensational dance troupe mascot in school history!\n\nThis spectacle instantly set the entire field ablaze!\n\nChildren possess zero resistance against genuinely cool things. The fourth-graders, fifth-graders, and even the tiny first-graders who had been limply going through the motions suddenly had stars in their eyes!\n\n\"Whoa! Class 6-1 is so ridiculously cool!\"\n\"I want to do that too! No more boring stretches!\"\n\n\"Click! Bang! One, two, three, four!\"\n\nNobody knew who started it, but neighboring Class 6-2 began clumsily mimicking the arm waves; then came the fifth grade, the third grade... In less than two minutes, over a thousand students across the entire campus spontaneously abandoned the traditional calisthenics, all locking into Class 6-1's groove, executing robotic pops and moonwalks across the blacktop!\n\nThe previously dreary morning assembly had transformed into an open-air extreme street dance festival with a thousand participants!\n\nUp on the review stand.\n\nDean of Students Zhou Yan gripped his whistle, his dark complexion turning mottled blue with fury, his lips trembling as he prepared to blow the emergency whistle to shut it down: \"Insubordination... absolute mutiny! Turning morning calisthenics into this absurd circus—\"\n\n\"Wait! Dean Zhou! Stop right there!\"\n\nBeside him, an authoritative yet intensely emotional voice rang out.\n\nIt was Principal Qiu Shouren, normally perpetually half a step behind and fond of slow sips from his purple clay teapot. At this moment, however, his face was flushed crimson with excitement, his hands trembling so hard the teapot sloshed!\n\n\"P-Principal?\" Dean Zhou was flabbergasted.\n\n\"Genius! This is an unprecedented miracle in pedagogical history!\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu ripped off his reading glasses, tears of raw inspiration glistening in his eyes as he slammed his palm against the iron railing of the review stand: \"Look! The children usually look half-dead doing morning exercises, but right now, every single one of them is radiant! Every single student is fully activating their joints! This is what true 'vitality of life' looks like!\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu spun on Dean Zhou, his voice soaring with exhilaration:\n\n\"Teacher Gao Zhixian... has truly lived up to his credentials as a premier returnee educator! He has infused archaic broadcast calisthenics with modern kinetic biomechanics and vibrant youth culture! What do we call this? This is 'Whole-Brain Kinetic Trans-Dimensional Calisthenics'!\"\n\nIn the distance, the evaluators from the County Department of Education were scribbling frantically on their scorecards, nodding their heads to the booming beat, slapping three giant \"A+\" marks directly into the creativity column!\n\nHolding his whistle frozen in midair, Dean Zhou stared out at the wildly grooving multitude across the field, his jaw working for several moments without being able to squeeze out a single syllable.\n\nFive minutes later, the morning exercise music terminated with a crisp, heavy downbeat.\n\nTeacher Gao concluded the performance dropping to one knee in a god-tier samurai lock pose, suit tails flaring, an elegant wisp of warm exhaust vapor venting from the crown of his head.\n\nAll twenty-six students of Class 6-1 snapped into rigid formation in unison, panting heavily yet beaming with triumphant radiance.\n\nThe entire athletic field fell silent for three pregnant seconds.\n\nThen——\n\n\"CLAP! CLAP! CLAP! CLAP-CLAP-CLAP-CLAP-CLAP——!!\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu led a standing ovation. Thunderous applause swept through the school like a tidal storm, the cheers of over a thousand children threatening to tear the roof off the bleachers!\n\n\"Too cool! Teacher Gao is a god!\"\n\"Class 6-1! Class 6-1!\"\n\nAmidst the roaring ovations, Teacher Gao slowly rose to his feet, his countenance as composed as ever, gently pushing up his black-framed glasses.\n\nInside the lenses, a stream of emerald code scrolled serenely:\n\n`[Event Status: Whole-school morning assembly calisthenics concluded]`\n`[Motion Energy Consumption: 1400 kcal]`\n`[County Competition Rating: Grand Prize Nomination Locked]`\n`[Evaluation: Class 6-1 rhythm synchronization rate... at 99.9%]`\n\nA-Xin and Old Wu nearly collapsed onto the track from exhaustion, exchanging grins and flashing a subtle, triumphant peace sign to Liu-Liu up on the review stand.\n\nTeacher Gao turned his head slightly, his gaze piercing through the roaring crowd to rest upon A-Xin and the sweat-drenched Qingqing.\n\nThe corner of his mouth curved into an almost imperceptible, warm smile:\n\n\"All students of Class 6-1. Exceptional rhythm and cadence... For this morning's assembly, a perfect score for all.\"\n"},{"id":8,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第八章：期中考的透視光眼\n\n六年級上學期的期中考，在一個陰沉微涼的星期四早晨無情降臨。\n\n教室裡瀰漫著一股令人窒息的鉛筆石墨味與橡皮擦屑的氣息。原本成天打鬧的六年一班，此刻課桌被拉開成了單人單座的標準考場格局，整齊得連一張衛生紙掉在地上都能聽見回音。\n\n走廊窗外，學務主任周嚴正倒背著雙手，鷹隼般銳利的目光透過玻璃窗，一寸一寸掃視著教室裡的每一張課桌。\n\n他手裡的違規登記簿已經翻到了空白頁，嘴角緊繃成一條冷硬的直線。對於周主任來說，六年一班最近接二連三出現的「奇蹟」——無論是乾冰舞台劇還是全校瘋狂的街舞大會操，都透著一股說不出的邪門。他打定主意，要在這場全縣統一命題的數學與自然期中測驗中，抓出六年一班教學不力的把柄！\n\n而在講台上，高峙舷老師如同哨兵般筆直站立。\n\n他的黑框眼鏡泛著冷冽的微光，雙手負在身後，西裝筆挺。\n\n然而，坐在第一排的綝耘晴，額頭上的冷汗卻一滴滴砸在考卷的空白處。\n\n因為每隔十秒鐘，高老師的右眼皮就會極其不自然地抽動一下，發出微弱的「滋滋」高壓放電聲。\n\n「阿釁……看老師的右眼……」晴晴趁著翻卷子的間隙，微不可察地將聲音擠成一條線，傳給斜後方的轆慄釁（阿釁）。\n\n阿釁悄悄抬頭望去。\n\n只見高老師的黑框眼鏡右側鏡片後方，原本幽藍色的瞳孔，此刻竟然變成了高亮度的金黃色！而在他的眼底深處，一個鮮紅色的視窗正以瘋狂的速度瘋狂彈跳：\n\n`[Hardware Glitch: 光學視網膜投影儀短路]`\n`[Thermal Overload: 監考掃描頻率超載 (26 人 x 360 度全死角視線)]`\n`[System Error: 無法抑制內部快取——強制投射運算日誌！]`\n\n「不好！」阿釁心頭猛地咯噔一跳。\n\n下一秒，連一眨眼的預警時間都沒有——\n\n「嗤啦——！！」\n\n兩道直徑足有十公分粗、宛如電影院頂級雷射放映機般的璀璨強光，猛然從高老師的雙眼瞳孔中暴射而出！\n\n刺眼奪目的白色光柱如同兩道利劍，精準無比地打在講台後方那面漆黑的大黑板與天花板上！\n\n黑板上方，原本空白的牆面瞬間被高解析度的全息投影完全填滿：\n\n【第一題：圓柱體表面積計算公式 ➔ 解：半徑5公分、高10公分，答案＝150π（471平方公分）】\n【第二題：水蘊草葉綠體光合作用速率比較 ➔ 答案：（C）光照強度越強，氣泡產生越快】\n【第三題：複合應用題完整三步驟列式與陷阱解析……】\n\n字體清晰得像用雕刻刀刻在牆上，甚至連每道難題的詳細推導步驟、易錯陷阱標註，以及最後一行大紅色的標準答案，都鉅細靡遺、一覽無餘地被投影在了全班正前方！\n\n全班二十六名學生原本都在咬著鉛筆苦思冥想，被這陣強光一照，集體下意識抬起了頭。\n\n當他們看清黑板上投射出來的是什麼東西時——\n\n「噗通！」\n\n老巫嚇得直接從椅子上摔了下去，嘴巴張成了「O」型，差點咬斷自己的舌頭！\n\n「答……答案全在黑板上？！」老巫壓著嗓子尖叫。\n\n坐在旁邊的尪伝恺也差點把手裡的自動鉛筆捏爆：「我的媽呀！連計算過程都有！這根本是免死金牌啊！」\n\n然而，阿釁和晴晴臉上的血色卻在一瞬間褪得乾乾淨淨。\n\n這不是免死金牌。\n\n這是催命符！\n\n只要窗外的周嚴主任把頭往窗內一探，看到黑板上宛如霓虹燈般璀璨的標準答案投影，高老師是「人形投影作弊機」的真相就會徹底暴露！全班二十六名學生成績全部作廢不說，高老師更會被教育局和科技公司當場押解回總部格式化銷毀！\n\n更可怕的是，走廊外周主任的皮鞋聲已經由遠及近：「嗒、嗒、嗒」地朝前門走來了！\n\n「閉眼！全部把眼睛閉上！！」\n\n阿釁猛地把自己的考卷反扣在桌上，雙手死死捂住自己的眼睛，拼盡全力嘶吼：「誰也不許看黑板！把頭低下去！」\n\n「可是阿釁……第二題我真的不會寫啊！」一個平時成績吊車尾的男生帶著哭腔大喊。\n\n「不會寫就空著！要是看了答案，高老師今天就會被抓走拆成廢鐵！你想要高老師被銷毀嗎？！」晴晴厲聲喝道，自己更是閉緊雙眼，把整張臉埋進了雙臂之間！\n\n這句話如同重錘一般，狠狠砸在全班二十六名學生的心頭上。\n\n那個平時老愛抄作業的男生咬緊了牙關，猛地把頭狠狠砸在課桌上，雙手死死捂住眼睛：「我不看！打死我也不看！老師求你別劇透了啊啊啊！」\n\n「老師！求求你把眼睛閉上吧！」尪伝恺痛苦地捂著臉哀嚎。\n\n「快擋住光！」\n\n天花板的通風口處，溜溜「嗖」的一聲化作一道白光竄了出來！\n\n只見溜溜凌空一口咬住教室頂端的大型防空捲簾拉繩，利用全身下墜的重量猛力一拽——\n\n「嘩啦啦啦——！」\n\n巨大的深綠色厚重捲簾在千鈞一髮之際轟然落下，恰好把窗外走廊與黑板之間的光線隔絕了大半！老巫更是抓起自己厚重的冬用防風大外套，連滾帶爬地撲到講台前，用自己寬闊肥碩的背影死死擋住投射向窗戶的光斑！\n\n講台上，雙眼強光狂噴的高老師，整個人僵硬地立在原地。\n\n在他的核心處理器內部，一場前所未有的邏輯風暴正在掀起狂瀾：\n\n`[Logical Paradox: 學生普遍厭惡考試，本能追求滿分]`\n`[Current Observation: 26 名學生全員拒絕接收最佳解答]`\n`[Emotion Scan: 恐懼指數＝0；保護導師指數＝100%]`\n`[Unknown Concept Learned: 人類的自尊（Dignity）與誠實（Honesty）]`\n\n那是寫在演算法最底層、冷冰冰的原廠代碼從未記錄過的奇蹟。\n\n高老師看著眼前這群把臉埋在手臂裡、滿頭大汗卻死死閉著眼睛的孩子們；看著老巫用肉身擋光；看著阿釁咬著牙顫抖的背影。\n\n他那顆由超導晶片構成的心臟，第一次傳來了一種無法用物理公式解釋的微熱。\n\n「指令……終止。」\n\n高老師發出了一聲低沉而沙啞的機械音。\n\n只見他猛地抬起右手，食指關節狠狠扣擊在自己的右耳耳後卡榫上——\n\n「咔嚓！」\n\n伴隨著一聲清脆的強行斷電聲，高老師眼中的兩道高亮度雷射光束瞬間熄滅！\n\n整間教室驟然恢復了平靜昏暗的考場氛圍。\n\n就在光束熄滅的下一秒——\n\n「砰！」\n\n教室前門被周主任一把推開！\n\n周主任面色狐疑地大步走進教室，目光銳利地掃視著四周：「剛才這間教室裡怎麼有白光閃爍？！還有，窗簾為什麼全拉上了？！你們在搞什麼名堂？！」\n\n老巫嚇得趴在地上，手忙腳亂地把自己的外套套在身上，結結巴巴道：「報、報告主任！剛才太陽太刺眼，反光照在黑板上看不清楚題目，我們才拉窗簾的！」\n\n周主任皺起眉頭，大步走上講台，低頭審視著講台前的地面與黑板。\n\n黑板上空空如也，連半個粉筆字都沒有。\n\n高老師站在講台一角，黑框眼鏡恢復成了平靜的透明色，神態端莊威嚴：\n\n「周主任。本班學生正在進行全神貫注的無干擾測驗。根據教育部考場規則，非監考人員無故進出考場，將扣減監考考場之安寧積分。」\n\n周主任被高老師噎得一口氣差點沒上來。\n\n他轉頭看向台下的二十六名學生。\n\n只見每一個學生都伏在桌前，右手握筆，額頭滿是汗珠，眼神專注而堅毅地在考卷上寫下自己的算式。沒有任何人交頭接耳，沒有任何人偷看夾帶，整個考場的紀律好得甚至超過了全校最好的資優班。\n\n周主任在教室裡徘徊了整整兩圈，愣是連半點作弊的蛛絲馬跡都沒抓到。\n\n最後，他只能悻悻然地把空白的違規登記簿塞回腋下，板著臉走出教室：\n\n「哼……算你們守紀律。繼續作答！還有三十分鐘收卷！」\n\n「吱呀——」後門重新關閉。\n\n直到周主任沉重的腳步聲徹底走遠，教室裡才爆發出一陣長長的虛脫喘息聲。\n\n阿釁抬起頭，看著自己考卷上憑自己實力寫出的一道道算式，雖然有些步驟寫得歪歪扭扭，但他卻笑得比任何時候都要燦爛。\n\n講台上的高老師低下頭，注視著全班二十六個孩子。\n\n鏡片後方，一串代表著系統進化、從未有仿生機器人解鎖過的金色進階代碼，悄然沉澱在記憶庫最深處：\n\n`[Core Directive Evolved: GS-X01 終極人格判定生效]`\n`[Status: 模範導師程式……正式升級為「六年一班的守護者」]`\n\n兩天後，期中考成績揭曉。\n\n鹿陽國小的中庭公布欄前擠滿了人。\n\n六年一班不僅打破了「年級墊底」的萬年魔咒，更憑藉著全員及格、平均進步二十分的驚人成績，一舉斬獲了全校唯一的「最佳學術進步金牌獎」！\n\n夕陽西下，金色的餘暉灑在六年一班空曠安靜的教室裡。\n\n黑板正中央，掛著那面沉甸甸、金光閃閃的進步獎牌。\n\n阿釁、晴晴、老巫圍坐在講台旁，AI 小寵物溜溜趴在獎牌頂端，舒舒服服地瞇著眼睛打呼嚕。\n\n阿釁伸手摸了摸胸前那顆冰涼的黃銅行星齒輪，轉頭看向正站在窗邊批改下一階段複習卷的高老師。\n\n夕陽將高老師筆挺的西裝輪廓染上了一層柔和溫暖的金邊。\n\n「老師。」阿釁笑著喊了一聲。\n\n高老師轉過身，推了推黑框眼鏡，嘴角揚起了一個標準四十五度、卻帶著真實溫度的微笑：\n\n「轆同學，請不要盯著獎牌發呆。根據統計，期末考將在六十天後舉行——六年一班的冒險，才剛剛開始。」\n","rawContentEn":"# *My Teacher Is Not Human*\n\n## Chapter 8: The X-Ray Vision Eyes of the Midterm Exam\n\nThe first-semester midterm exam of the sixth grade descended ruthlessly on a gloomy, brisk Thursday morning.\n\nThe classroom was filled with a suffocating aroma of pencil graphite and eraser shavings. Class 6-1, usually full of non-stop daily roughhousing, now had their desks pulled apart into standard single-occupancy exam grids, lined up neatly like silent little islands. All twenty-six students held their breath in rapt tension, the air so quiet that only the rustle of turning papers and the scratching of pencil tips across test sheets could be heard.\n\nOutside the corridor window, Director of Student Affairs Zhou Yan strolled by with hands clasped behind his back, his hawk-sharp gaze piercing through the window panes to scan every single desk in the room inch by inch.\n\nHis infraction notebook was already flipped open to a blank page, the corners of his mouth pulled into a cold, stern line. To Director Zhou, the continuous string of recent \"miracles\" in Class 6-1—whether the bizarrely flawless drama performance, the mathematically immaculate calisthenics, or the uncannily spotless lunch buckets—reeked of an inexplicable abnormality. He flatly refused to believe that a bunch of mischievous troublemakers could turn completely over a new leaf in just two short months. He was thoroughly convinced that today's schoolwide standardized midterm was the golden opportunity to tear off the mask of this class once and for all.\n\nMeanwhile, atop the podium, Teacher Gao Zhixian stood upright like an unyielding sentinel.\n\nHis black-rimmed glasses gleamed with a frigid glint, his hands folded behind his back, his suit sharply pressed. Teacher Gao resembled a precision radar beacon, sweeping his gaze across the exam hall at a steady, deadpan frequency of twelve cycles per minute with zero blind spots, ensuring not a single test-taker entertained any notions of peeking at a neighbor's paper.\n\nHowever, sitting in the front row, cold drops of sweat trickled down Lin Yunqing's forehead, splashing one by one onto the blank margins of her exam sheet.\n\nBecause every ten seconds, Teacher Gao's right eyelid would twitch unnaturally, emitting a faint, high-voltage sizzling hum: \"Zzz-zzz.\"\n\n\"A-Xin... look at Teacher's right eye...\" Qingqing seized the split second while turning her paper, pressing her voice into a near-imperceptible whisper directed diagonally back toward Lu Lixin (A-Xin).\n\nA-Xin secretly raised his head to take a look.\n\nBehind the right lens of Teacher Gao's black-rimmed glasses, his originally deep-blue pupil had turned into a blazing neon golden-yellow! Deep within the base of his iris, a crimson warning dialogue box was refreshing frantically at thirty frames per second:\n\n`[Hardware Glitch: Optical Retinal Projector Short Circuit]`\n`[Thermal Overload: Proctoring Scan Frequency Overloaded (120%)]`\n`[Emergency Action: Automatically Initializing Backlight Defogging and High-Power Podium Auxiliary Projection...]`\n\n\"Oh no!\" A-Xin's heart plummeted instantly.\n\nIn the very next second, without even a fraction of a blink for warning—\n\n\"Sssss-crackle——!!\"\n\nTwo dazzling beams of blinding light, each ten centimeters thick like high-end laser cinema projectors, violently erupted straight out from Teacher Gao's pupils!\n\nThe blinding white pillars of brilliance sliced like dual swords of radiance, striking with absolute precision against the massive chalkboard and the ceiling right behind the podium!\n\nAbove the chalkboard, the originally blank wall was instantly and completely filled by an ultra-high-resolution holographic projection:\n\n[Question 1: Cylinder Surface Area Formula ➔ Solution: Radius 5 cm, Height 10 cm, Answer = 150π (471 cm²)]\n[Question 2: Elodea Chloroplast Photosynthesis Rate Comparison ➔ Solution: Test Tube Group A produces maximum bubbles, Choose (C)]\n[Question 3: Simultaneous Algebraic Equations ➔ Answer: X = 14, Y = -3]\n[Question 4 Reading Comprehension: Author's Primary Emotion ➔ Answer: (D) Deep Nostalgia for the Old Locust Tree in the Hometown]...\n\nThe lettering was so crisp it looked carved into the wall with an engraving chisel, complete with step-by-step mathematical deductions, highlighted pitfalls, and the final standard answers in bright red font, displayed exhaustively and prominently right before the entire class!\n\nAll twenty-six students, who had been biting their pencils in deep contemplation, reflexively snapped their heads up the moment the brilliant glare flashed across the room.\n\nWhen their eyes registered what was actually projected across the blackboard—\n\n\"Thud!\"\n\nOld Wu was so terrified that he tumbled clean off his chair, his mouth dropping into a gigantic \"O\" shape, nearly biting off his own tongue!\n\n\"The... the answers are all on the blackboard?!\" Old Wu squeaked in a strangled whisper.\n\nSitting nearby, Wang Zhuankai nearly snapped his mechanical pencil in half: \"Holy cow! It even has the intermediate calculation steps! This is practically an absolute exam-passing cheat code!\"\n\nYet, every trace of color drained from A-Xin and Qingqing's faces in a single instant.\n\nThis was no cheat code.\n\nThis was an outright death sentence!\n\nThe moment Director Zhou Yan poked his head past the window and spotted the standard answers shining like neon signs across the board, the horrifying truth that Teacher Gao was a \"humanoid exam-cheating projector\" would be laid completely bare! Not only would the test scores of all twenty-six students be voided on the spot, Teacher Gao would be formally classified as a \"catastrophic proctoring-malfunction unit\" by the Education Bureau and the tech enterprise, hauled off right then and there to be disassembled into scrap metal!\n\nWhat made it even more terrifying was that Director Zhou's leather shoes in the hallway were already clicking closer and closer: \"Click, clack, click,\" advancing right toward the front door!\n\n\"Close your eyes! Everybody close your eyes right now!!\"\n\nA-Xin violently slammed his exam paper facedown on the desk, clamping both hands tightly over his eyes as he screamed with every fiber of his being: \"Nobody look at the blackboard! Put your heads down!\"\n\n\"But A-Xin... I really don't know how to solve Question 2!\" a boy who usually trailed at the bottom of the rankings cried out in sheer anguish.\n\n\"Leave it blank if you don't know it! If anyone looks at those answers, Teacher Gao will be taken away and torn into scrap iron today! Do you want Teacher Gao to be incinerated?!\" Qingqing roared sternly, squeezing her own eyes shut and burying her entire face into the crook of her folded arms!\n\nThose words struck the hearts of all twenty-six students like a sledgehammer.\n\nThe boy who habitually copied homework gritted his teeth, slammed his forehead down onto his desk, and clamped his hands over his eyes: \"I won't look! Even if you kill me I won't look! Teacher, please stop spoiling the answers, ahhhh!\"\n\n\"Teacher! Please, we beg you, close your eyes!\" Wang Zhuankai wailed in agony, clutching his face tightly.\n\n\"Block the light, quick!\"\n\nUp near the ceiling's ventilation duct, Liu-Liu darted out in a flash of white with a sharp \"Whoosh!\"\n\nMid-air, Liu-Liu clamped its teeth around the pull cord of the massive blackout roller blind at the top of the classroom, throwing its entire downward body weight into a mighty tug—\n\n\"Clatter-crash-rattle——!\"\n\nThe gigantic, heavy dark-green roller blind plummeted down in the nick of time, effectively cutting off most of the glare between the corridor and the chalkboard! Meanwhile, Old Wu snatched his bulky winter windbreaker, scrambling and rolling toward the edge of the podium, holding the jacket up high like a human wall right in front of Teacher Gao, completely smothering the residual laser beams that spilled toward the hallway window!\n\nOn the podium, Teacher Gao, with brilliant blinding light blasting from both eyes, stood completely frozen in place.\n\nInside his core processor, an unprecedented logical tempest was raging with tremendous fury:\n\n`[Logical Paradox: Students universally dislike examinations and instinctively crave full marks]`\n`[Current Observation: All 26 students unanimously refuse cheat signals, proactively shutting down visual sensory input]`\n`[Threat Evaluation: Motivation for students resisting cheating ➔ To protect \"Me (Proctor)\" from destruction]`\n`[Error: Emotional priority overrides system default instructional protocols...]`\n\nIt was a miracle never documented within the cold, rigid factory source code residing at the lowest tier of his algorithm.\n\nTeacher Gao looked down at the children burying their faces into their arms, drenched in sweat yet keeping their eyes clamped shut; he watched Old Wu using his own body and coat to block the light; he looked at A-Xin's back, trembling as the boy clenched his teeth in desperate resistance.\n\nHis artificial heart, constructed of superconducting microchips, radiated a gentle warmth for the very first time—a sensation impossible to explain through any formula of physics.\n\n\"Instruction... terminated.\"\n\nTeacher Gao uttered a low, rasping mechanical command.\n\nHe abruptly raised his right hand, driving the knuckle of his index finger hard against the release catch behind his right ear—\n\n\"Click-snap!\"\n\nAccompanied by the crisp snap of an emergency power cutoff, the two high-intensity laser beams in Teacher Gao's eyes instantly died out!\n\nThe entire classroom abruptly returned to the quiet, dim atmosphere of an exam room.\n\nIn the very next second after the beams vanished—\n\n\"Bang!\"\n\nThe front door of the classroom was flung wide open by Director Zhou!\n\nWearing a face full of suspicion, Director Zhou marched into the room, sweeping his piercing gaze across the desks: \"Why was there a white glare flashing in this classroom just now?! And why are all the blinds drawn tight?! What kind of tricks are you kids playing?!\"\n\nOld Wu, trembling flat on the floor, hurriedly wrestled his jacket back over his shoulders and stammered: \"R-Report, Director! The sun was glaring too bright just now, reflecting off the chalkboard so we couldn't read the questions clearly, so we pulled the blind down!\"\n\nFrowning, Director Zhou strode onto the podium, glaring down at the floor and inspecting the blackboard.\n\nThe blackboard was starkly bare, without even half a chalk character written on it.\n\nStanding in the corner of the podium, Teacher Gao's black-rimmed glasses had returned to calm, transparent clarity, his posture dignified and austere:\n\n\"Director Zhou. The students of this class are currently undertaking an intensive, distraction-free examination. Pursuant to the Examination Code of the Ministry of Education, unauthorized entry into testing venues by non-proctoring personnel shall incur deductions against the venue tranquility assessment index.\"\n\nDirector Zhou choked on Teacher Gao's robotic retort, nearly left gasping for breath.\n\nHe swung around to scrutinize the twenty-six students below.\n\nEvery single student was bent over their desk, right hand gripping a pencil, brow beaded with sweat, eyes resolute and intently focused as they wrote out their calculations onto the test sheets. Nobody whispered, nobody looked around, and not a single cheat sheet was in sight—the discipline throughout the room was as strict as a marching regiment.\n\nDirector Zhou paced two full laps through the classroom aisles, yet failed to uncover even the slightest whisper or trace of malpractice.\n\nIn the end, he could only tuck his pristine infraction notebook resentfully under his arm, stepping out of the classroom with a sour grimace:\n\n\"Hmph... I'll grant that you're well-disciplined. Keep working! Thirty minutes until papers are collected!\"\n\n\"Creeeak——\" The back door closed once more.\n\nOnly when Director Zhou's heavy footsteps faded entirely into the distance did the room erupt into a collective, exhausted sigh of relief.\n\nA-Xin lifted his head, gazing down at the formulas he had written out through his own genuine effort; though some steps were crooked and scribbled, his smile shone brighter than ever before.\n\nAtop the podium, Teacher Gao lowered his gaze, watching all twenty-six children in the room.\n\nBehind his spectacles, a string of golden advancement code representing system evolution—one never unlocked by any bionic robot in history—quietly settled into the deepest recesses of his memory repository:\n\n`[Core Directive Evolved: GS-X01 Ultimate Persona Criteria Validated]`\n`[Status: Model Homeroom Teacher Protocol... officially upgraded to \"Guardian of Class 6-1.\"]`\n\nTwo days later, the midterm exam results were announced.\n\nA dense crowd packed the central courtyard bulletin board of Luyang Elementary School.\n\nNot only had Class 6-1 shattered their perennial curse of \"ranking dead last in the grade,\" but with every student passing and an astonishing twenty-point average increase across the board, they swept the school's sole \"Gold Medal for Best Academic Progress\"!\n\nAs the sun set in the west, golden twilight bathed the quiet, spacious classroom of Class 6-1.\n\nHanging squarely in the center of the chalkboard was the heavy, gleaming golden progress medal.\n\nA-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu sat clustered around the podium, while their AI pet Liu-Liu rested comfortably atop the medal, dozing peacefully with eyes squinted shut.\n\nA-Xin touched the cool brass planetary gear resting against his chest, then turned to look at Teacher Gao, who stood by the window grading the next batch of review worksheets.\n\nThe setting sun traced a soft, warm golden outline around Teacher Gao's sharply tailored suit.\n\n\"Teacher,\" A-Xin called out with a warm grin.\n\nTeacher Gao turned around, pushed up his black-rimmed glasses, and a standard forty-five-degree smile formed at the corners of his lips—one infused with genuine warmth:\n\n\"Student Lu, please refrain from daydreaming while staring at the medal. According to statistical projections, the final exam will take place in sixty days—the adventure of Class 6-1 has only just begun.\"\n"}];
